ast%20month%2C%20is%20raising%20again%20for%20his%20new%20AI%20startup%2C%20Discovery%20Loop%2C%20this%20time%20seeking%20a%20valuation%20of%20around%20%2450%20billion%2C%20according%20to%20people%20familiar%20with%20the%20matter.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIt%20was%20only%20a%20few%20weeks%20ago%20that%20Discovery%20Loop%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fformer-google-exec-jeff-dean-valuation-for-new-ai-startup-2026-8%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Ewas%20raising%20%241%20billion%20dollars%20at%20around%20a%20%2410%20billion%20valuation%2C%3C%2Fa%3E%20Business%20Insider%20reported.%20But%20in%20this%20white-hot%20fundraising%20market%20where%20VCs'%20voracious%20appetite%20for%20top%20AI%20talent%20such%20as%20Dean%20is%20matched%20only%20by%20the%20enormous%20expense%20of%20building%20an%20AI%20lab%2C%20it%20seems%20it%20is%20never%20too%20soon%20to%20raise%20funding%20again.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EA%20spokesperson%20for%20Discovery%20Loop%20declined%20to%20comment.%20Dean%20did%20not%20respond%20to%20a%20request%20for%20comment.%20Terms%20of%20the%20deal%20could%20change%2C%20and%20there%20is%20no%20guarantee%20Discovery%20Loop%20will%20be%20able%20to%20raise%20a%20round%20of%20funding%20at%20that%20valuation.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.discoveryloop.com%2F%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EDiscovery%20Loop%20describes%20itself%20%3C%2Fa%3Eas%20%26quot%3Bautomating%20discovery%20to%20accelerate%20science%20and%20engineering%20for%20the%20world.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20company%20hopes%20to%20tackle%20some%20of%20science%20and%20engineering's%20hardest%20problems%20through%20the%20%26quot%3Bparallel%20execution%20of%20thousands%20of%20experiments.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BOur%20goal%20is%20to%20build%20AI%20that%20acts%20as%20a%20genuinely%20positive%2C%20empowering%20force%20for%20humanity%3A%20not%20just%20a%20tool%2C%20but%20a%20partner%20in%20solving%20the%20problems%20that%20matter%20most%2C%26quot%3B%20Discovery%20Loop%20says%20on%20its%20careers%20page%2C%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fjobs.ashbyhq.com%2FDiscovery-Loop%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Ewhere%20it%20is%20hiring%20just%20one%20role.%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fwhy-jeff-dean-left-google-ai-startup-discovery-loop-2026-8%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EDean%20said%20at%20a%20talk%20last%20month%20%3C%2Fa%3Ethat%20he%20and%20his%20cofounders%20%26quot%3Bmight%20make%20decisions%20that%20are%20not%20in%20the%20company's%20financial%20interest%20but%20are%20in%20the%20broader%20societal%20good.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EA%20Discovery%20Loop%20press%20release%20from%20last%20month%20said%20that%20the%20company's%20initial%20funding%20round%20was%20being%20led%20by%20Radical%20Ventures%20and%20Khosla%20Ventures%2C%20with%20participation%20from%20Lightspeed%2C%20Kleiner%20Perkins%2C%20and%20Doerr%20Capital.%20Alphabet%20was%20a%20founding%20investor%20and%20cloud%20partner%2C%20according%20to%20Google%20CEO%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fsundar-pichai-google-alphabet-ceo-career-life%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3ESundar%20Pichai%3C%2Fa%3E.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EDean%2C%20who%20was%20regarded%20as%20a%20legend%20inside%20Google%2C%20has%20gotten%20most%20of%20the%20attention.%20But%20Discovery%20Loop's%20other%20three%20founders%20bring%20decades%20of%20experience%20in%20their%20own%20right%2C%20building%20some%20of%20Google's%20most%20important%20products.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ESanjay%20Ghemawat%2C%20a%20longtime%20collaborator%20of%20Dean%20who%20joined%20Google%20in%201999%2C%20helped%20develop%20foundational%20distributed-computing%20technologies.%20Quoc%20Le%2C%20a%20founding%20member%20of%20Google%20Brain%2C%20became%20a%20prominent%20researcher%20in%20deep%20learning%20and%20large-scale%20neural%20networks%2C%20contributing%20to%20advances%20in%20language%20models%20and%20other%20foundation%20models.%20Oriol%20Vinyals%2C%20meanwhile%2C%20was%20a%20leading%20researcher%20at%20Google%20DeepMind%20whose%20work%20spans%20sequence%20modeling%20and%20reinforcement%20learning.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fjeff-dean-startup-pitch-deck-slides-discovery-loop-google-products-2026-8%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EDean%20shared%20a%20pitch%20deck%20on%20X%20%3C%2Fa%3Ethat%20one%20former%20Google%20product%20leader%20called%20%26quot%3Bone%20of%20the%20most%20stacked%20pitch%20decks%20ever%20made.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EOne%20slide%20lists%20products%20the%20founding%20team%20worked%20on%2C%20including%20Google%20Search%2C%20Ads%2C%20Gemini%2C%20and%20Gmail.%20Another%20slide%20focuses%20on%20academic%20credentials%2C%20showing%20Google%20Scholar%20rankings%20placing%20Dean%2C%20Le%2C%20and%20Vinyals%20among%20the%20most%20highly%20cited%20AI%20researchers.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BThis%20team%20can%20redefine%20how%20research%20in%20engineering%20and%20science%20is%20done.%20If%20successful%2C%20the%20impact%20won't%20be%20measured%20in%20software%20features%2C%20or%20benchmarks%20but%20in%20new%20science%20to%20improve%20billions%20of%20lives%2C%26quot%3B%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fx.com%2Fsearch%3Fq%3Ddiscovery%2520loop%26src%3Dtyped_query%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Eventure%20investor%20Vinod%20Khosla%20posted%20last%20month%2C%20%3C%2Fa%3Ecomparing%20Discovery%20Loop%20to%20his%20early%20investment%20in%20OpenAI.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EOther%20new%20AI%20labs%2C%20such%20as%20Safe%20Superintelligence%20and%20Thinking%20Machines%20Lab%2C%20have%20raised%20staggering%20sums%20at%20eyepopping%20valuations%20before%20they%20had%20products.%20It%20is%20something%20that%20would%20have%20seemed%20inconceivable%20in%20previous%20fundraising%20cycles%20but%20reflects%20investors'%20conviction%20that%20a%20small%20number%20of%20elite%20technical%20teams%20could%20become%20the%20next%20generation%20of%20fro