0a%20wine%20tour%3C%2Fa%3E.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EIn%20my%20opinion%2C%20Catania%2C%20Sicily%2C%20is%20a%20must-visit%20location.%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%226777%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22An%20Italian%20city%20with%20Mount%20Etna%20in%20the%20distance.%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F681249923fe8d39283647dd1%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%225083%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3E%3Cp%3ESergio%20Formoso%2FGetty%20Images%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EIf%20Sicily%20is%20on%20your%20itinerary%2C%20a%20trip%20to%20Catania%20is%20a%20must.%20The%20city%20is%20at%20the%20foot%20of%20Mount%20Etna%2C%20the%20highest%20active%20volcano%20in%20Europe.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIn%20fact%2C%20the%20volcano%20is%20integral%20to%20local%20tourism%2C%20architecture%2C%20and%20wine%20production.%20Guides%20offer%20hiking%20tours%20during%20dormancy%2C%20allowing%20visitors%20to%20walk%20the%20crater%20rim.%20The%20volcanic%20stone%20is%20also%20used%20to%20build%20local%20churches%2C%20plazas%2C%20and%20roadways.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ESicily's%20food%20and%20wine%20scene%20is%20also%20reason%20enough%20to%20visit%20this%20part%20of%20Italy.%20The%20volcanic%20ash%20can%20help%20enrich%20the%20soil%2C%20providing%20nutrients%20for%20vineyards%20that%20produce%20incredible%20wine.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EHowever%2C%20I'd%20skip%20Naples%20and%20head%20to%20Italy's%20southern%20coastal%20gems%20instead.%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%225547%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22A%20city%20near%20the%20water%2C%20with%20a%20volcano%20in%20the%20distance.%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6812601a3fe8d39283648391%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%224160%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3E%3Cp%3EBoris%20Stroujko%2FShutterstock%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EFellow%20travelers%20warned%20me%20that%20Naples%20fell%20short%20of%20their%20expectations%2C%20but%20I%20wanted%20to%20experience%20the%20city%20for%20myself.%20So%2C%20I%20visited%20twice%20during%20a%20solo%20trip%20last%20year%2C%20staying%20on%20opposite%20sides%20of%20the%20city%20each%20time.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAlthough%20the%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fcommon-mistakes-youre-making-with-homemade-pizza-how-to-fix-2022-2%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3ENeapolitan%20pizza%3C%2Fa%3E%20did%20not%20disappoint%2C%20navigating%20the%20sprawling%2C%20hilly%20city%20on%20foot%20was%20challenging.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20local%20metro%20system%20was%20convenient%20for%20getting%20around%2C%20but%20it%20turned%20out%20to%20be%20a%20persistent%20target%20for%20pickpockets.%20After%20witnessing%20a%20few%20such%20instances%20firsthand%2C%20I%20made%20the%20choice%20to%20avoid%20taking%20the%20trains%20at%20night.%20However%2C%20that%20meant%20my%20taxi%20fares%20added%20up%20quickly%20after%20evenings%20spent%20out.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EOverall%2C%20if%20I'm%20going%20to%20be%20in%20Southern%20Italy%20I'd%20much%20rather%20pop%20over%20to%20the%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fthings-to-do-on-amalfi-coast-according-to-local-2024-9%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EAmalfi%20Coast%3C%2Fa%3E%20or%20other%20nearby%20destinations.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EIn%20my%20opinion%2C%20one%20trip%20to%20Venice%20was%20enough.%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%224089%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Gondolas%20in%20the%20water%20next%20to%20colorful%20buildings%20lining%20the%20canal.%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F681261863fe8d392836483fb%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%223066%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3E%3Cp%3EEfired%2FShutterstock%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EThere's%20a%20lot%20to%20love%20about%20Venice%2C%20from%20the%20unique%20architecture%20to%20the%20outstanding%20glasswork.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EUnfortunately%2C%20though%2C%20I%20was%20underwhelmed%20by%20the%20food%20and%20noticed%20some%20things%20like%20souvenirs%2C%20meals%2C%20and%20experiences%20were%20more%20expensive%20than%20they%20were%20in%20other%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fwhy-perugia-best-place-in-italy-better-than-rome-2024-9%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EItalian%20cities%3C%2Fa%3E%20I'd%20visited.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAlthough%20the%20architecture%20is%20stunning%2C%20the%20narrow%2C%20winding%20streets%20also%20made%20it%20difficult%20to%20navigate%20the%20city%20and%20added%20to%20the%20feeling%20of%20overcrowding.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAdditional%20planning%20is%20now%20needed%20to%20visit%2C%20as%20the%20city%20requires%20tourism%20permits%20on%20certain%20days.%20Considering%20the%20expense%2C%20challenges%20with%20walkability%2C%20and%20additional%20planning%20required%2C%20I%20likely%20won't%20return%20to%20Venice%20for%20another%20visit.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cem%3EThis%20story%20was%20originally%20published%20on%20May%203%2C%202025%2C%20and%20most%20recently%20updated%20on%20September%2011%2C%202026.%3C%2Fem%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3ERead%20the%20original%20article%20on%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Ffavorite-cities-italy-places-not-worth-visiting-from-frequent-traveler-2026-9%5C%22%3EBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%22%2C%22published%22%3A1789155795000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa4598fec15fe2d3cf1678b%3Fformat%3Djpeg%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Ffavorite-cities-italy-places-not-worth-visiting-from-frequent-traveler-2026-9%22%2C%22summary%22%3A%22After%20visiting%2021%20cities%20and%20villages%20in%20Italy%2C%20there%20are%20a%20few%20places%20I%20wouldn't%20go%20back%20to.%20However%2C%20I'd%20gladly%20return%20to%20cities%20like%20Verona.%22%2C%22author%22%3A%22insider%40insider.com%20(Alison%20Van%20Glad)%22%2C%22engagement%22%3A0%2C%22canonicalUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22cdnAmpUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22ampUrl%22%3A%22%22%7D%2C%7B%22title%22%3A%22Elon%20