%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa441eb9b8974787b1cb278%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%223267%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EGoogle%20CEO%20Sundar%20Pichai.%3Cp%3EBloomberg%2FGetty%20Images%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cul%3E%3Cli%3EMechanize's%20ex-CEO%20Tamay%20Besiroglu%2C%20along%20with%20over%20a%20dozen%20other%20employees%2C%20now%20work%20at%20Google.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EThe%20deal's%20terms%20weren't%20disclosed.%20Google%20had%20been%20in%20talks%20for%20a%20%241.5%20billion-plus%20deal%2C%20per%20sources.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EMechanize%20launched%20last%20year%20with%20a%20mission%20of%20automating%20every%20job%20in%20the%20world.%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%3Cp%3EGoogle%20has%20some%20fresh%20talent%20in%20the%20AI%20race.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20tech%20giant%20has%20completed%20its%20talent%20deal%20with%20San%20Francisco%20startup%20Mechanize%20Inc%2C%20public%20postings%20show.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EMechanize's%20co-founder%20and%20ex-CEO%2C%20Tamay%20Besiroglu%2C%20now%20works%20as%20a%20research%20scientist%20at%20Google's%20AI%20division%2C%20DeepMind%2C%20according%20to%20his%20LinkedIn%20profile.%20Over%20a%20dozen%20other%20former%20Mechanize%20employees%20now%20work%20at%20Google%2C%20per%20LinkedIn%2C%20mostly%20on%20the%20company's%20'midtraining'%20efforts%20%E2%80%94%20a%20key%20part%20of%20building%20the%20best%20chatbot.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EGoogle%20and%20Besiroglu%20declined%20to%20comment.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EGoogle%20had%20been%20in%20talks%20for%20a%20%241.5%20billion-plus%20deal%20for%20Mechanize's%20tech%20and%20talent%2C%20Business%20Insider%20previously%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fgoogle-mechanize-deal-talent-tech-ai-coding-2026-8%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Ereported%3C%2Fa%3E.%20The%20final%20terms%20of%20the%20deal%20weren't%20disclosed.%20Mechanize's%20former%20chief%20of%20staff%2C%20Guive%20Assadi%2C%20now%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Fin%2Fguive-assadi%2F%5C%22%20target%3