%2C000%20into%20debt%20in%20his%20late%2050s%20and%20is%20rebuilding%20his%20finances%20in%20his%2060s.%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cem%3EThis%20as-told-to%20essay%20is%20based%20on%20a%20conversation%20with%20Christos%20Garkinos%2C%20founder%20of%3C%2Fem%3E%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.covetbychristos.com%2F%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3E%3Cem%3ECovet%20by%20Christos%3C%2Fem%3E%3C%2Fa%3E%3Cem%3E.%20It%20has%20been%20edited%20for%20length%20and%20clarity%3C%2Fem%3E.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI%20learned%20from%20a%20very%20young%20age%20what%20success%20meant%3A%20it%20was%20money%20in%20the%20till%20after%20the%20lunch%20rush.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EMy%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fkids-first-international-trip-why-athens-good-choice-greece-tips-2025-4%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EGreek%20immigrant%3C%2Fa%3E%20parents%20owned%20a%20diner%20in%20Detroit.%20Each%20day%2C%20150%20people%20would%20flood%20in%20for%20lunch%2C%20and%20my%20family%20would%20fall%20apart.%20My%20mom%20would%20be%20screaming%2C%20throwing%20things%20at%20my%20dad%3B%20as%20a%20kid%2C%20I%20wondered%20every%20day%20if%20we%20would%20make%20it%20through.%20But%20two%20hours%20later%2C%20with%20the%20money%20in%20the%20till%2C%20we'd%20all%20be%20having%20fun.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EMy%20dad%20was%20diagnosed%20with%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2F49-year-old-triathlete-diagnosed-stage-4-lung-cancer-2026-6%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Elung%20cancer%3C%2Fa%3E%20when%20I%20was%20in%20my%2020s.%20The%20business%20failed%2C%20and%20so%20did%20his%20health.%20I%20was%20making%20good%20money%20working%20for%20major%20global%20companies%20like%20Disney%20and%20Virgin%2C%20but%20I%20never%20felt%20financially%20secure.%20That's%20partially%20because%20I%20sent%20a%20good%20portion%20of%20my%20check%20home%20to%20support%20my%20parents.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22cad85640-a061-450f-8fbb-da8975d45453%5C%22%3EI%20took%