2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Flos-angeles-best-things-according-to-local-2023-6%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Eliving%20in%20LA%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20working%20in%20fashion%2C%20which%20had%20been%20my%20dream%20since%20I'd%20first%20heard%20the%20%26quot%3Bclick%20clack%26quot%3B%20of%20high%20heels%20as%20a%20boy.%20I%20had%20a%20lot%20going%20for%20me%2C%20and%20eventually%20landed%20a%20reality%20show%20that%20I%20leveraged%20into%20a%20spot%20on%20the%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Flive-selling-streaming-tiktok-whatnot-palmstreet-ecommerce-entrepreneurs-side-hustle-2025-11%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EHome%20Shopping%20Network%3C%2Fa%3E.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI%20had%20been%20absolutely%20obsessed%20with%20the%20network%20since%20I%20was%2014.%20When%20I%20went%20to%20Florida%20and%20saw%20a%20set%20with%20my%20name%20on%20it%2C%20I%20freaked%20out.%20A%20part%20of%20me%20thought%2C%20%26quot%3BWhat%20can%20I%20do%20to%20mess%20this%20up%3F%26quot%3B%20I%20was%20still%20self-sabotaging.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThen%2C%20my%20best%20friend%20died%20of%20cancer.%20I%20had%20already%20been%20running%20with%20a%20fast%20crowd%2C%20but%20when%20I%20walked%20out%20of%20her%20funeral%2C%20I%20walked%20out%20of%20my%20life.%20I%20left%20my%20husband%2C%20my%20business%2C%20and%20myself.%20I%20was%20in%20a%20tailspin%20for%20three%20years.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%223daee0d4-c41a-43d4-a82e-ddcfd8222d0d%5C%22%3EI%20spent%20my%20retirement%20savings%20and%20went%20about%20%24500%2C000%20into%20debt%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EEven%20in%20those%20days%2C%20my%20life%20looked%20beautiful%20from%20the%20outside.%20I%20was%20living%20in%20a%20gorgeous%20house%20I%20was%20renting%20at%20the%20top%20of%20Mulholland%20Drive.%20And%20yet%2C%20my%20whole%20life%20was%20put%20on%20my%20American%20Express%20card%2C%20because%20I%20always%20needed%20another%2030-day%20buffer.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EOne%20day%2C%20in%20that%20fancy%20house%2C%20I%20called%20my%20mom