nd%20yet%2C%20there's%20still%20part%20of%20me%20that%20doesn't%20feel%20secure.%20When%20I%20worry%2C%20I%20remind%20myself%20of%20the%20changes%20I've%20made.%20I'm%20sober.%20I%20have%20a%20business%20manager.%20I%20know%20my%20habits%20around%20money.%20Yet%20I'm%20still%20working%20hard%20to%20build%20this%20business%20and%20sell%20it%20eventually.%20For%20me%2C%20that%20will%20mean%20next-level%20financial%20stability.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cdiv%3ERead%20the%20original%20article%20on%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Flooked-rich-500k-debt-credit-cards-retirement2026-9%5C%22%3EBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%22%2C%22published%22%3A1789151941000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa05bf29b8974787b1c990e%3Fformat%3Djpeg%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Flooked-rich-500k-debt-credit-cards-retirement2026-9%22%2C%22summary%22%3A%22Christos%20Garkinos%20looked%20successful%20from%20the%20outside%20while%20accumulating%20%24500%2C000%20in%20debt%20and%20draining%20the%20retirement%20savings%20that%20made%20him%20feel%20safe.%22%2C%22author%22%3A%22insider%40insider.com%20(Kelly%20Burch)%22%2C%22engagement%22%3A0%2C%22canonicalUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22cdnAmpUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22ampUrl%22%3A%22%22%7D%2C%7B%22title%22%3A%22Stephanie%20Ahn%E2%80%99s%20Seven-Year%20Road%20to%20%E2%80%98Bedford%20Park%E2%80%99%3A%20%E2%80%98You%20Never%20Know%20What%20Can%20Make%20Your%20Film%20Better%E2%80%99%22%2C%22content%22%3A%22%22%2C%22published%22%3A1789151700000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fvariety.com%2F%3Fp%3D1236857340%22%2C%22summary%22%3A%22After%20winning%20the%20U.S.%20Dramatic%20Special%20Jury%20Award%20for%20Debut%20Feature%20at%20Sundance%20this%20year%2C%20%E2%80%9CBedford%20Park%E2%80%9D%20has%20its%20international%20premiere%20at%20the%20Toronto%20Film%20Festival%2C%20ahead%20of%20a%20U.S.%20theatrical%20release%20by%20Sony%20Pictures%20Classics.%20Speaking%20with%20Vari