ging%20Face%20CEO%20Clement%20Delangue%20compared%20a%20former%20Anthropic%20researcher's%20AI%20fears%20to%20those%20of%20an%20%26quot%3BAC%20guy%26quot%3B%20talking%20about%20climate%20change.%3Cp%3EBloomberg%2FGetty%20Images%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cul%3E%3Cli%3EHugging%20Face%20CEO%20Clement%20Delangue%20isn't%20here%20for%20the%20Jacob%20Coxon%20discourse.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3ECoxon%20went%20viral%20after%20posting%20that%20he%20resigned%20from%20Anthropic%20due%20to%20concerns%20about%20AI's%20risks.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EDelangue%20suggested%20that%20Coxon%20doesn't%20have%20the%20requisite%20expertise%20to%20make%20such%20a%20claim.%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%3Cp%3EHugging%20Face%20CEO%20Clement%20Delangue%20questioned%20the%20focus%20on%20a%20former%20Anthropic%20researcher%20who%20said%20AI%20workers%20privately%20fear%20the%20technology%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fai-doomer-predictions-not-new-jacob-coxon-anthropic-2026-9%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Ecould%20kill%20all%20humans.%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BSorry%2C%20but%20asking%20Jacob%20about%20AI%20extinction%20risk%20is%20like%20asking%20your%20AC%20guy%20about%20climate%20change%2C%26quot%3B%20Delangue%20wrote%20on%20X%20on%20Friday.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EDelangue%20said%20that%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fanthropic-researcher-quits-over-ai-safety-concerns-2026-9%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EJacob%20Coxon%2C%20the%20former%20Anthropic%20researcher%20%3C%2Fa%3Ewhose%20resignation%20has%20sparked%20a%20renewed%20debate%20about%20AI's%20risks%2C%20should%20be%20put%20into%20the%20proper%20context.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BNot%20saying%20it's%20necessarily%20uninteresting%20or%20wrong%20per%20se%20but%20let's%20keep%20things%20in%20perspective%20and%20hear%20from%20the%20full%20range%20of%20expertise%20across%20the%20ecosystem!%26quot%3B%20Delangue%20wrote.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ECoxon%20wrote%20on%20Tuesday%20on%20X%20that%20he%20was%20resigning%20due%20to%20concerns%20that%20both%20Anthropic%20and%20OpenAI%2C%20where%20he%20previously%20worked%2C%20are%20%26quot%3Bracing%20straight%20to%20self-improving%20superintelligence%20and%20gambling%20with%20our%20lives.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BThe%20people%20building%20AI%20earnestly%20believe%20that%20it%20could%20kill%20us%20all%20by%20the%20end%20of%20the%20decade%2C%26quot%3B%20he%20wrote.%20%26quot%3BThis%20is%20not%20a%20marketing%20stunt.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EDelangue%20later%20said%20that%20his%20comparison%20to%20an%20%26quot%3BAC%20guy%26quot%3B%20was%20not%20meant%20%26quot%3Bto%20discredit%26quot%3B%20Coxon%20%26quot%3Bat%20all.%26quot%3B%20Rather%2C%20Delangue%20said%2C%20there%20needs%20to%20be%20a%20more%20robust%20conversation%20about%20AI's%20risks.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BIt's%20simply%20that%20we%20should%20put%20any%20one%20perspective%20in%20context%20and%20listen%20to%20the%20broader%20AI%20ecosystem%20too%2C%26quot%3B%20he%20wrote.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EDelangue%20also%20said%20it%20was%20his%20%26quot%3Bunderstanding%26quot%3B%20that%20Coxon%20mostly%20focused%20on%20pretraining%2C%20in%20which%20researchers%20train%20AI%20models%20on%20large%20datasets%2C%20rather%20than%20more%20risk-focused%20research.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIn%20his%20series%20of%20posts%2C%20Coxon%20said%20he%20worked%20on%20pretraining%20research%20at%20both%20OpenAI%20and%20Anthropic%20%26quot%3Bfor%20the%20last%20three%20years.%26quot%3B%20Ethan%20Perez%2C%20alignment%20team%20lead%20at%20Anthropic%2C%20later%20wrote%20on%20X%20that%20Coxon%20was%20a%20%26quot%3Bsenior%20researcher%20who%20joined%20Anthropic%20in%20May%26quot%3B%20and%20that%20OpenAI's%20chief%20rival%20had%20been%20trying%20to%20recruit%20Coxon%20for%20roughly%20two%20years.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ESome%20in%20tech%2C%20like%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Felon-musk%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3ESpaceX%20CEO%20Elon%20Musk%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20whose%20company%20includes%20SpaceXAI%2C%20have%20been%20critical%20of%20Coxon's%20claims.%20In%20response%20to%20someone%20who%20recounted%20the%20lead-up%20to%20The%20Wall%20Street%20Journal's%20initial%20story%20on%20Coxon's%20resignation%20(which%20came%20before%20Coxon's%20tweets)%2C%20the%20SpaceX%20CEO%20wrote%20that%20%26quot%3Bthe%20groundwork%20for%20this%20psy%20op%20(for%20lack%20of%20a%20better%20term)%20has%20been%20prepared%20for%20a%20long%20time.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EOthers%2C%20including%20researchers%20at%20Anthropic%20and%20OpenAI%2C%20have%20said%20Coxon's%20claims%20about%20the%20risk%20of%20AI%20wiping%20out%20humanity%20are%20well-founded.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BJacob%20is%20correct%20here%E2%80%94we%20really%20do%20earnestly%20believe%20AI%20could%20kill%20all%20humans!%26quot%3B%20Evan%20Hubinger%2C%20the%20alignment%20science%20lead%20at%20Anthropic%2C%20wrote%20on%20X.%20%26quot%3BI%20personally%20think%20it%20is%20%3E10%25%20within%20the%20next%20decade.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAs%20for%20other%20perspectives%20that%20might%20be%20helpful%2C%20Delangue%20wrote%20in%20a%20reply%20that%20includes%2C%20%26quot%3Bsocial%20scientists%2C%20other%20AI%20builders%2C%20futurists%2C%20investors%2C%20policymakers.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EDelangue%20and%20Hugging%20Face's%20profiles%20have%20exploded%20since%20OpenAI%20announced%20in%20July%20that%20rogue%20AI%20models%20had%20broken%20containment%20during%20cybersecurity%20testing%20and%20breached%20Hugging%20Face%20in%20an%20effort%20to%20cheat%20on%20internal%20tests.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EOn%20September%203%2C%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fnvidia%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3ENvidia%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20which%20is%20highly%20reliant%20on%20AI-related%20demand%20for%20its%20chips%2C%20announced%20plans%20to%C2%A0%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fnvidia-confirms-hugging-face-acquisition-13-billion-deal-jensen-huang-2026-9%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Eacquire%20Hugging%20Face%20for%20nearly%3C%2Fa%3E%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fnvidia-confirms-hugging-face-acquisition-13-billion-deal-jensen-huang-2026-9%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3E%20%2413%20billion%3C%2Fa%3E.%20If%20policymakers%20were%20to%20slam%20the%20brakes%20on%20frontier%20AI%20development%20(a%20call%20some%20have%20renewed%20in%20the%20wake%20of%20Coxon's%20comments)%2C%20Nvidia%20would%20likely%20be%20significantly%20affected.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cdiv%3ERead%20the%20original%20article%20on%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fhugging-face-clement-delangue-jacob-coxon-ac-guy-2026-9%5C%22%3EBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%22%2C%22published%22%3A1789151105000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa43b4d9b8974787b1cb1f9%3Fformat%3Djpeg%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fhugging-face-clement-delangue-jacob-coxon-ac-guy-2026-9%22%2C%22summary%22%3A%22%26quot%3BSorry%2C%20but%20asking%20Jacob%20about%20AI%20extinction%20risk%20is%20like%20asking%20your%20AC%20guy%20about%20climate%20change%2C%26quot%3B%20Hugging%20Face%20CEO%20Clement%20Delangue%20wrote%20on%20X.%22%2C%22author%22%3A%22bgriffiths%40insider.com%20(Brent%20D.%20Griffiths)%22%2C%22engagement%22%3A96%2C%22canonicalUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22cdnAmpUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22ampUrl%22%3A%22%22%7D%2C%7B%22title%22%3A%22States%20should%20not%20put%20a%20price%20cap%20on%20EV%20road%20tax%20benefit%3A%20BMW%20India%20CEO%22%2C%22content%22%3A%22%22%2C%22published%22%3A1789150992000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fbsmedia.business-standard.com%2F_media%2Fbs%2Fimg%2Farticle%2F2025-10%2F10%2Fthumb%2Ffitandfill%2F1200X628%2F1760105175-3334.jpg%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.business-standard.com%2Fcompanies%2Fnews%2Fstates-should-not-cap-road-tax-benefits-for-evs-based-on-price-bmw-india-126091101316_1.html%22%2C%22summary%22%3A%22BMW%20India%20chief%20Hardeep%20Singh%20Brar%20says%20price-b