%20audit%20review%20that%20flagged%20governance%20lapses%22%2C%22author%22%3A%22%22%2C%22engagement%22%3A96%2C%22canonicalUrl%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.business-standard.com%2Fcompanies%2Fnews%2Fcoforge-nrc-chair-resigns-citing-differences-tension-between-directors-126091101348_1.html%22%2C%22cdnAmpUrl%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww-business--standard-com.cdn.ampproject.org%2Fc%2Fs%2Fwww.business-standard.com%2Famp%2Fcompanies%2Fnews%2Fcoforge-nrc-chair-resigns-citing-differences-tension-between-directors-126091101348_1.html%22%2C%22ampUrl%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.business-standard.com%2Famp%2Fcompanies%2Fnews%2Fcoforge-nrc-chair-resigns-citing-differences-tension-between-directors-126091101348_1.html%22%7D%2C%7B%22title%22%3A%22Apple's%20new%20CEO%20was%20asked%20about%20'pervert%20glasses.'%20Here%20was%20his%20response.%22%2C%22content%22%3A%22%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%225500%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22John%20Ternus%20speaks%20during%20an%20Apple%20event%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa422e59b8974787b1cb0b5%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%223667%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EApple%20CEO%20John%20Ternus%20says%20the%20company%20wants%20%26quot%3Bpeople%20around%20the%20user%20feel%20comfortable%26quot%3B%20about%20the%20Apple%20Watch's%20new%20AI%20listening%20features.%3Cp%3ECarlos%20Barria%2FReuters%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cul%3E%3Cli%3EApple%20CEO%20John%20Ternus%20wants%20people%20to%20feel%20comfortable%20about%20the%20Apple%20Watch's%20new%20AI%20listening%20capabilities.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3ETernus%20was%20asked%20about%20concerns%20about%20AI%20glasses%2C%20specifically%20that%20some%20have%20called%20them%20%26quot%3Bpervert%20glasses.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EApple%20exec%20Greg%20Joswiak%20called%20it%20%26quot%3Bquite%20a%20marketing%20slogan.%26quot%3B%20Ternus%20stressed%20that%20the%20Apple%20Watch%20features%20don't%20record.%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%3Cp%3EApple%20would%20kindly%20like%20to%20stay%20far%20away%20from%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fbusinessinsider.com%2Fmeta%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EMeta's%3C%2Fa%3E%20ongoing%20reputational%20challenges%20with%20AI%20glasses.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fmeet-apple-ceo-john-ternus-replacing-tim-cook-2026-4%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EApple%20CEO%20John%20Ternus%3C%2Fa%3E%20was%20recently%20asked%20about%20how%20the%20company%20thinks%20about%20privacy%20in%20the%20age%20of%20AI%20wearables%20in%20light%20of%20backlash%20around%20AI%20glasses%20like%20Meta's.%20After%20all%2C%20Apple%20is%20rumored%20to%20be%20cooking%20up%20some%20AI%20glasses%20of%20its%20own%20in%20its%20labs.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BI%20know%20you%20can't%20talk%20about%20unannounced%20products%2C%20but%20what%20do%20you%20think%20about%20the%20backlash%20around%20what%20people%20are%20calling%2C%20you%20know%2C%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fmeta-glasses-facial-recognition-kylie-jenner-2026-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3E'pervert%20glasses%2C'%3C%2Fa%3E%26quot%3B%20Tom's%20Guide%20editor%20in%20chief%20Mark%20Spoonauer%20asked.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cdiv%20data-script%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20data-styles%3D%5C%22default-width%5C%22%20data-embed-type%3D%5C%22youtube%5C%22%20data-type%3D%5C%22embed%5C%22%3E%3Ciframe%20referrerpolicy%3D%5C%22strict-origin-when-cross-origin%5C%22%20allowfullscreen%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.youtube.com%2Fembed%2FHWg75OAmJLc%3Ffeature%3Doembed%5C%22%20width%3D%5C%22560%5C%22%20title%3D%5C%22Apple%E2%80%99s%20new%20CEO%20on%20what%20comes%20after%20iPhone%20Duo%20%7C%20Inside%20John%20Ternus'%20first%20week%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%22315%5C%22%3E%3C%2Fiframe%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cp%3EBefore%20Ternus%20could%20answer%2C%20Greg%20Joswiak%2C%20Apple's%20senior%20vice%20president%20of%20worldwide%20marketing%20who%20also%20being%20interviewed%2C%20quipped%3A%20%26quot%3BThat's%20quite%20a%20marketing%20slogan.%26quot%3B%20The%20remark%20drew%20laughter%20from%20Ternus.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EMeta%20is%20actively%20fighting%20back%20at%20that%20perception%20with%20a%20marketing%20blitz%20that%20emphasizes%20the%20AI%20glasses'%20light%20that%20alerts%20people%20when%20the%20recording%20feature%20is%20activated.%20It's%20also%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fmeta-smart-glasses-pr-problem-camera-privacy-led-light-2026-8%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Etaken%20steps%20to%20thwart%20users%3C%2Fa%3E%20who%20tamper%20with%20that%20light%20and%20pledged%20to%20remove%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Finstagram-crackdown-meta-ai-glasses-pickup-rizz-videos-moderation-challenges-2026-8%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3E%26quot%3Bharassing%26quot%3B%20videos%3C%2Fa%3E%20recorded%20by%20the%20AI%20glasses%20from%20Instagram%20(%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Finstagram-crackdown-meta-ai-glasses-pickup-rizz-videos-moderation-challenges-2026-8%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EBusiness%20Insider%20has%20found%20those%20moderation%20efforts%3C%2Fa%3E%20are%20off%20to%20a%20bumpy%20start.)%20Meta%20declined%20to%20comment%20on%20the%20Apple%20executives'%20remarks.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EBeyond%20some%20laughter%20at%20a%20rival's%20expense%2C%20the%20pair%20of%20Apple%20execs%20instead%20looked%20to%20explain%20how%20the%20company%20hopes%20to%20address%20privacy%20concerns%20when%20it%20releases%20two%20new%20AI-enabled%20listening%20features%20alongside%20the%20next%20generation%20of%20Apple%20Watches.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BWe%20wanted%20to%20do%20this%20in%20a%20way%20that%20people%20feel%20comfortable%20using%20it%2C%20and%20people%20around%20the%20user%20feel%20comfortable%20about%20its%20existence%2C%26quot%3B%20Ternus%20said.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EWhile%20its%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fapple-iphone-duo-foldable-2026-9%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Efirst%20foldable%20phone%2C%20iPhone%20Duo%2C%3C%2Fa%3E%20stole%20the%20show%2C%20Apple%20also%20announced%20that%20Apple%20Watch%20Series%2012%20and%20Apple%20Watch%20Ultra%204%20will%20come%20with%20optional%20%26quot%3Baudio%20intelligence%26quot%3B%20features%20that%2C%20depending%20on%20a%20user's%20preference%2C%20can%20mean%20Siri%20is%20always%20listening%20to%20your%20conversations%20throughout%20the%20day.%20Apple%20says%20the%20features%20don't%20start%20working%20until%20the%20on-device%20AI%20detects%20speech%20and%20that%20no%20audio%20is%20recorded%20or%20stored.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%222940%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Apple's%20Rewind%20Audio%20Intelligence%20feature%20on%20the%20new%20Apple%20Watch%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa1caa39b8974787b1ca420%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221644%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EApple's%20Live%20Rewind%20Audio%20Intelligence%20feature%20on%20the%20new%20Apple%20Watch%3Cp%3EApple%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EOne%20feature%2C%20%26quot%3BSiri%20Recap%2C%26quot%3B%20can%20listen%20to%20meetings%20or%20even%20your%20whole%20day%20and%20generate%20what%20the%20company%20calls%20%26quot%3Bhigh-level%26quot%3B%20notes%20on%20what%20happened.%20Another%20feature%2C%20Live%20Rewind%2C%20shows%20a%20text%20snippet%20of%20the%20last%2015%20seconds%20of%20what%20was%20just%20said%20around%20you%20on%20the%20Apple%20Watch's%20screen.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ETernus%20and%20Joswiak%20emphasized%20that%20neither%20feature%20includes%20speaker%20attribution.%20There's%20also%20no%20audio%20recording%20that%20the%20user%20could%20store%20for%20later%20playback.%20Apple%20also%20says%20it%20doesn't%20have%20access%20to%20the%20raw%20audio%20files.%20Joswiak%20also%20said%20this%20means%20Apple%20can't%20be%20compelled%20to%20turn%20over%20an%20audio%20file.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BIt's%20just%20those%20higher-level%20notes%20to%20remind%20you%20of%20that%20without%20getting%20into%20all%20the%20stuff%20that%20really%20is%20privacy%20concerning%20which%20a%20lot%20of%20other%20products%20are%20doing%2C%26quot%3B%20Joswiak%20said.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EWhile%20they%20did%20not%20mention%20it%2C%20the%20Live%20Rewind%20feature%20also%20includes%20audio%20and%20visual%20cues%20on%20the%20Apple%20Watch's%20screen%20%E2%80%94%20similar%20to%20the%20recording%20light%20on%20Meta's%20AI%20glasses%20%E2%80%94%20to%20alert%20those%20around%20the%20watch%20wearer%20that%20the%20last%2015%20seconds%20of%20conversation%20is%20being%20processed.%20Apple%20says%20%26quot%3BLive%20Rewind%26quot%3B%20and%20%26quot%3BSiri%20Recap%26quot%3B%20will%20be%20available%20in%20beta%20later%20this%20year.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EBoth%20Apple%20execs%20also%20said%20that%20current%20apps%20have%20long%20allowed%20users%20to%20record%20themselves%20and%20those%20around%20them.%20While%20they%20didn't%20mention%20anything%20in%20particular%2C%20AI-enabled%20apps%20and%20devices%20like%20Granola%20and%20Plaud%20are%20also%20designed%20for%20such%20use%20cases.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EBut%20the%20Apple%20execs'%20response%20to%20the%20question%20highlights%20that%20Apple%20is%20seeking%20to%20differentiate%20its%20approach%20to%20information-gathering%20on%20AI%20devices.%20Whether%20or%20not%20people%20ultimately%20feel%20comfortable%20about%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fapple-watch-siri-recap-live-rewind-audio-intelligence-features-2026-9%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EApple%20Watches%20listening%20in%20on%20their%20conversations%3C%2Fa%3E%20is%20another%20question%20altogether.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cdiv%3ERead%20the%20original%20article%20on%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fapple-ceo-ai-glasses-watch-privacy-concerns-meta-2026-9%5C%22%3EBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%22%2C%22published%22%3A1789149154000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa422f1cc23a829a3b905f2%3Fformat%3Djpeg%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fapple-ceo-ai-glasses-watch-privacy-conce