-inside-the-75-million-bombardier-global-7500-private-jet-2022-12%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Emultimillion-dollar%20private%20jets%3C%2Fa%3E%20for%20A-list%20celebrities%20like%20Matt%20Damon%20and%20Beyonc%C3%A9%20%E2%80%94%20has%20been%20among%20the%20targets%20of%20President%20Donald%20Trump's%20escalating%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Ftrump-bans-alcohol-tariffs-cheese-us-canada-trade-war-escalation-2026-9%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Etrade%20war%20with%20Canada%3C%2Fa%3E.%20The%20aerospace%20sector%20was%20not%20among%20the%20president's%20latest%20sweeping%20tariffs%2C%20but%20he%20still%20floated%20the%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Ftrump-stop-canada-bombardier-sold-us-2026-9%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Eidea%20of%20banning%20Bombardier%3C%2Fa%3E%20from%20selling%20in%20the%20US.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIn%20a%20Monday%20Truth%20Social%20post%2C%20Trump%20said%20the%20planemaker%20is%20%26quot%3Btreating%20America%20like%20a%20'piggybank'%26quot%3B%20and%20must%20build%20here%20if%20it%20wants%20access%20to%20the%20US%20market%3A%20%26quot%3BNO%20MORE%20SELLING%20BOMBARDIER%20IN%20THE%20UNITED%20STATES!%26quot%3B%20he%20wrote.%20%26quot%3BTheir%20products%20aren't%20good%20enough!%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EBombardier%20quickly%20released%20a%20statement%2C%20and%20without%20naming%20Trump%2C%20pointed%20to%20the%20company's%20deep%20presence%20in%20the%20US%3A%20It%20described%20thousands%20of%20direct%20jobs%20across%20over%2020%20states%2C%20%242.5%20billion%20spent%20across%20roughly%202%2C800%20American%20suppliers%20in%2047%20states%20each%20year%2C%20and%20a%20network%20of%20offices%2C%20maintenance%20facilities%2C%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Finside-worlds-largest-purpose-built-private-jet-bombardier-global-7500-2022-1%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Emanufacturing%20plants%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20and%20service%20centers%20that%20serve%20its%20high-net-worth%20customers.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIts%20US%20headquarters%20are%20in%20Wichita%2C%20Kansas%2C%20where%20the%20Learjet%20was%20manufactured%20until%20the%20program's%20end%20in%202022%2C%20but%20now%20focuses%20on%20defense%2C%20flight%20testing%2C%20and%20servicing.%20It%20also%20builds%20wings%20in%20Texas%20and%20flight%20control%20components%20in%20California%2C%20and%20it%20has%20a%20large%20parts%20distribution%20center%20in%20Chicago%20that%20has%20operated%20since%202005.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIt%20also%20has%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fbombardier.com%2Fen%2Fcareers%2Fmobile-response-team%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Emobile%20truck%20response%20team%20centers%3C%2Fa%3E%20%E2%80%94%20technicians%20dispatched%20to%20assist%20grounded%20aircraft%20in%20need%20of%20repair%2C%20technical%20assistance%2C%20or%20parts%20%E2%80%94%20based%20in%2013%20states.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EOverall%2C%20Bombardier%20said%20it%20employs%203%2C500%20direct%20employees%20in%20the%20US.%20And%20despite%20threats%20from%20Trump%2C%20it%20told%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.reuters.com%2Flegal%2Flitigation%2Fbombardier-still-recruiting-fill-500-open-us-positions-despite-trump-threats-2026-09-09%2F%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EReuters%3C%2Fa%3E%20on%20Wednesday%20that%20it%20wants%20to%20hire%20another%20500%2C%20some%20of%20whom%20will%20work%20at%20a%20new%20service%20center%20set%20to%20open%20in%20Indiana%20in%20November.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ESome%20Republicans%20have%20publicly%20defended%20Bombardier.%20In%20a%20Monday%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.moran.senate.gov%2Fpublic%2Findex.cfm%2Fnews-releases%3Fid%3D0C62AB1D-C26A-4F77-871C-807E44E76628%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Estatement%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20US%20Sen.%20Jerry%20Moran%20of%20Kansas%20said%20Wichita%20employs%20over%201%2C000%20Americans%20and%20that%20he'd%20contacted%20the%20president%20to%20ensure%20he%20is%20%26quot%3Baware%20of%20the%20significant%20contributions%20of%20Bombardier%20to%20Kansas.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20state's%20other%20Republican%20senator%2C%20Sen.%20Roger%20Marshall%2C%20said%20in%20a%20Tuesday%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fx.com%2FRogerMarshallMD%2Fstatus%2F2097351267047686208%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EX%3C%2Fa%3E%20post%20that%20he'd%20%26quot%3Bfight%26quot%3B%20for%20Bombardier's%20Kansas%20workforce%20and%20that%20he%20had%20already%20voiced%20his%20concerns%20to%20the%20White%20House.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EBombardier%20and%20the%20White%20House%20did%20not%20immediately%20respond%20to%20a%20request%20for%20comment.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIt's%20not%20the%20first%20time%20Trump%20has%20threatened%20Bombardier.%20In%20January%202026%2C%20the%20president%20threatened%20to%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fcanadian-planes-rj-bombardier-trump-gulfstream-tariff-threat-faa-safety-2026-1%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Ede-certify%20Canadian-built%20planes%3C%2Fa%3E%20unless%20Canada's%20transport%20authority%20certified%20certain%20American-made%20Gulfstream%20jets.%20Canada%20did%20so%20a%20month%20later%2C%20and%20Trump's%20threat%20fizzled%20out.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EHere%20are%20the%20states%20where%20Bombardier%20has%20direct%20workers.%20Much%20of%20Bombardier's%20indirect%20support%20comes%20from%20suppliers%20and%20authorized%20pilot%20training%20and%20service%20contractors.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EArizona%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%221613%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Bombarider%20global%207500%20after%20flying%20from%20Singapore.%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa4136c9b8974787b1cb024%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221075%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EBombardier%20flew%20the%20world's%20longest-range%20business%20jet%20flight%20from%20Singapore%20to%20Tucson%20in%202019%20using%20a%20Global%207500.%20It%20later%20broke%20that%20record%20flying%20from%20Sydney%20to%20Detroit.%3Cp%3EBombardier%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigu