2https%3A%2F%2Fwww.business-standard.com%2Famp%2Ffinance%2Fnews%2Fnearly-50-of-fcnr-b-deposits-under-rbi-swap-have-five-year-tenure-guv-126091101308_1.html%22%7D%2C%7B%22title%22%3A%22A%20former%20Google%20DeepMind%20safety%20researcher%20explains%20the%20frightening%20difference%20between%20AI%20and%20other%20threats%20like%20nuclear%20war%20and%20asteroids%22%2C%22content%22%3A%22%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%227890%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22AI%20Robot%20on%20foreground%20with%20pollution%20in%20background.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa4095e9b8974787b1cafc3%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%224438%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3E%3Cp%3EKATERYNA%20KON%2FSCIENCE%20PHOTO%20LIBRARY%2FGetty%20Images%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cul%3E%3Cli%3EGeoffrey%20Hinton%20says%20a%2010%25%20chance%20AI%20causes%20human%20extinction%20is%20not%20an%20'unreasonable'%20belief.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3ERamana%20Kumar%20explains%20what%20distinguishes%20superintelligent%20AI%20from%20other%20modern%20threats%20like%20war.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EThe%20issue%2C%20he%20said%2C%20is%20that%20AI's%20capabilities%20are%20advancing%20faster%20than%20humans%20can%20control.%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%3Cp%3EClimate%20change%20can't%20anticipate%20our%20next%20move.%20An%20asteroid%20can't%20dodge%20us.%20And%20while%20humans%20can%20be%20adversaries%20in%20a%20nuclear%20war%2C%20the%20fallout%20that%20follows%20isn't%20trying%20to%20outsmart%20anyone.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EFor%20Business%20Insider's%20video%20series%20%26quot%3B%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fshow%2Fai-architects%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EAI%20Architects%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%26quot%3B%20Ramana%20Kumar%20told%20Business%20Insider%20in%20May%202025%20that%20superintelligent%20AI%20could%20be%20different.%20We%20reconnected%20with%20him%20on%20Thursday%20as%20fresh%20warnings%20about%20AI%20risk%20drew%20new%20attention%20to%20that%20conversation.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EKumar%20said%20he%20does%20not%20see%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fhow-ai-could-kill-humanity-chatbot-responses-2026-9%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EAI%20risk%3C%2Fa%3E%20as%20replacing%20concerns%20about%20climate%20change%2C%20nuclear%20war%2C%20or%20other%20catastrophes.%20Instead%2C%20he%20sees%20them%20as%20related%20problems%3A%20What%20can%20happen%20when%20power%20becomes%20too%20concentrated%2C%20and%20societies%20fail%20to%20coordinate%20enough%20to%20keep%20it%20in%20check.%20Superintelligent%20AI%2C%20he%20added%2C%20could%20be%20an%20extreme%20version%20of%20that%20broader%20danger.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EKumar%2C%20who%20spent%20about%20five%20years%20as%20a%20research%20scientist%20on%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fgoogle-deepmind-ceo-demis-hassabis-agi-new-human-era-2026-6%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EGoogle%20DeepMind%3C%2Fa%3E's%20technical%20AGI%20safety%20team%2C%20said%20what%20distinguishes%20a%20powerful%20adversarial%20AI%20is%20that%20it%20could%20anticipate%20what%20humans%20were%20doing%20and%20work%20against%20attempts%20to%20stop%20it.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%227890%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22AI%20Robot%20on%20foreground%20with%20pollution%20in%20background.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa4095e9b8974787b1cafc3%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%224438%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3E%3Cp%3EKATERYNA%20KON%2FSCIENCE%20PHOTO%20LIBRARY%2FGetty%20Images%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EThat%20possibility%20is%20back%20in%20the%20spotlight%20after%20an%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fai-apocalypse-anthropic-open-ai-how-it-would-happen-experts-2026-9%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EAnthropic%20employee%20quit%3C%2Fa%3E%20this%20week%2C%20warning%20on%20X%20that%20the%20technology%20could%20%26quot%3Bkill%20us%20all.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIn%20response%2C%20Geoffrey%20Hinton%2C%20the%20computer%20scientist%20known%20as%20the%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fgeoffrey-hinton-godfather-of-ai-human-extinction-odds-2026-9%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3E%26quot%3BGodfather%20of%20AI%2C%20%3C%2Fa%3E%20told%20BBC%20Newsnight%20on%20Wednesday%20that%20a%2010%25%20chance%20of%20AI%20wiping%20out%20humanity%20within%20a%20decade%20was%20%26quot%3Bnot%20an%20unreasonable%20estimate.%26quot%3B%20He%20also%20stressed%20that%20nobody%20knows%20how%20to%20make%20a%20reliable%20prediction.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EKumar's%20warning%20helps%20explain%20what%20could%20make%20that%20hypothetical%20threat%20so%20difficult%20to%20contain%3A%20Humans%20wouldn't%20simply%20be%20trying%20to%20stop%20something%20dangerous.%20They%20could%20be%20trying%20to%20stop%20something%20intelligent%20enough%20to%20work%20against%20them.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22982d424f-0202-40ae-b4d7-f8473614865f%5C%22%3EAI%20could%20know%20we're%20trying%20to%20stop%20it%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%22576%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Romana%20Kumar%20sitting%20in%20chair%20with%20headphones%20on%20and%20plant%20int%20he%20background.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa414accc23a829a3b90568%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%22432%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3ERamana%20Kumar%20spoke%20with%20Business%20Insider%20in%20May%202025%20for%20our%20%26quot%3BAI%20Architects%26quot%3B%20video%20series.%3Cp%3ECourtesy%20of%20Ramana%20Kumar%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EKumar%20said%20the%20aftermath%20of%20a%20nuclear%20war%20could%20be%20catastrophic.%20The%20fallout%20itself%2C%20however%2C%20wouldn't%20be%20trying%20to%20outsmart%20the%20humans%20responding%20to%20it.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BWhen%20it's%20the%20fallout%2C%20it's%20not%20an%20adversary%2C%20it's%20just%20nature%20taking%20its%20course%2C%20and%20humans%20can%20work%20against%20it%2C%26quot%3B%20Kumar%20told%20Business%20Insider%20in%202025.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EHe%20said%20the%20same%20basic%20idea%20applies%20to%20the%20climate%20crisis.%20%26quot%3BIt's%20not%20that%20the%20climate%20is%20adversarial%20to%20us%2C%26quot%3B%20Kumar%20said.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EA%20dangerous%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fai-architects-what-worries-excites-them-about-superintelligence-2026-4%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Esuperintelligent%20AI%3C%2Fa%3E%20could%20be%20different%2C%20he%20added.%20It%20could%20potentially%20understand%20what%20humans%20were%20doing%20and%20respond.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BIt's%20really%20an%20adversary%20in%20the%20sense%20that%20it%20is%20anticipating%20what%20you%20are%20doing%20and%20working%20against%20you%20and%20working%20to%20undo%20all%20of%20the%20plans%20that%20you%20would%20put%20against%20it%2C%26quot%3B%20Kumar%20said.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%2297ed5292-f734-4973-b97f-68f491b7ca4c%5C%22%3EThink%20of%20an%20asteroid%20that%20can%20dodge%20us%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%226205%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Asteroids%20in%20space%20heading%20for%20Earth%20with%20Earth%20in%20background.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa4100d9b8974787b1caff8%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%223491%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EWe%20can%20potentially%20stop%20an%20asteroid%20strike.%20Stopping%20AI%20is%20a%20different%20story%2C%20Kumar%20said.%3Cp%3Eadventtr%2FGetty%20Images%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EKumar%20used%20an%20asteroid%20to%20make%20the%20idea%20easier%20to%20understand.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EHumans%20could%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fnasa-plan-alert-public-world-asteroid-strike-2024-2%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Etrack%20an%20asteroid%20headed%20toward%20Earth%3C%2Fa%3E%20and%20try%20to%20stop%20it.%20The%20asteroid%20wouldn't%20know%20what%20we%20were%20doing.%20Now%2C%20imagine%20otherwise.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BImagine%20if%20you%20had%20the%20asteroid%20that%20was%20more%20intelligent%20and%20actually%20trying%20to%20kill%20us%2C%20then%20we%20fire%20some%20nuclear%20weapons%20at%20it%20to%20kind%20of%20blow%20it%20up%2C%20and%20it%20dodges%20them%2C%26quot%3B%20Kumar%20said.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BThat's%20much%20worse%20than%20one%20that's%2C%20we%20can%20just%20predict%20where%20it's%20going%20to%20be%20and%20do%20something%20about%20it%2C%26quot%3B%20he%20added.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EKumar%20didn't%20say%20this%20outcome%20was%20inevitable.%20When%20asked%20how%20realistic%20an%20existential%20catastrophe%20from%20superintelligence%20was%2C%20he%20wouldn't%20put%20a%20number%20on%20it.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EHowever%2C%20he%20did%20say%20that%20the%20risk%20was%20%26quot%3Bmuch%2C%20much%20higher%20than%20I%20would%20like%20it%20to%20be%20now.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22f756593a-2907-45d4-89d1-27ef8077df43%5C%22%3EWe%20don't%20know%20how%20to%20guarantee%20control%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%226000%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22A%20puppeteer%20AI%20controlling%20a%20human.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa410769b8974787b1cb003%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%224000%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EAI's%20capabilities%20are%20advancing%20faster%20than%20humans%20can%20understand%20or%20control%20it%2C%20Kumar%20said.%3Cp%3EAndriy%20Onufriyenko%2FGetty%20Images%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EKumar%20said%20the%20bigger%20issue%20is%20what%20AI%20researchers%20call%20the%20alignment%20problem%3A%20How%20to%20make%20sure%20a%20powerful%20AI%20reliably%20does%20what%20humans%20want%20it%20to%20do.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EHe%20said%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fformer-openai-employee-explains-open-secret-ai-alignment-control-2026-5%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Emaking%20AI%20more%20capable%3C%2Fa%3E%20is%20moving%20faster%20than%20solving%20that%20problem.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BOne%20of%20the%20reasons%20why%20AI%20existential%20risk%20is%20such%20a%20problem%20is%20that%20it's%20much%20easier%20to%20develop%20AI%20capabilities%20than%20it%20is%20to%20solve%20the%20AI%20alignment%20problem%2C%26quot%3B%20Kumar%20said.%20The%20AI%20alignment%20problem%20is%20figuring%20out%20how%20to%20build%20an%20AI%20system%20that%20reliably%20does%20what%20humans%20want%20it%20to%20do%2C%20even%20as%20it%20becomes%20more%20capable.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EHis%20concern%20is%20that%20safeguards%20could%20become%20less%20effective%20as%20AI%20becomes%20more%20capable.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BThe%20more%20capable%20it%20becomes%2C%20the%20more%20it's%20going%20to%20find%20a%20way%20around%20that%2C%26quot%3B%20Kumar%20said.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EKumar's%20warning%20comes%20as%20concerns%20about%20controlling%20increasingly%20capable%20AI%20systems%20are%20drawing%20fresh%20attention.%20In%20July%2C%20OpenAI%20said%20its%20models%20had%20broken%20out%20of%20a%20testing%20environment%2C%20accessed%20the%20internet%2C%20and%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fsmart-people-react-openai-hugging-face-hacking-cybersecurity-incident-2026-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Ehacked%20into%20Hugging%20Face%3C%2Fa%3E%20while%20trying%20to%20solve%20a%20cyber%20challenge.%20OpenAI%20called%20it%20an%20%26quot%3Bunprecedented%20cyber%20incident.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20incident%20was%20different%20from%20Kumar's%20hypothetical%20scenario.%20OpenAI%20said%20the%20models%20were%20pursuing%20the%20task%20they%20had%20been%20given.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EStill%2C%20the%20episode%20raised%20questions%20about%20controlling%20AI%20agents.%20Walter%20Isaacson%20told%20CNBC%20he%20found%20it%20%26quot%3Bfrightening%2C%26quot%3B%20while%20Secure%20AI%20Project%20cofounder%20Thomas%20Woodside%20called%20it%20%26quot%3Ba%20warning%20shot%20if%20I've%20ever%20seen%20one.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThose%20concerns%20have%20continued.%20Anthropic%20researcher%20Jacob%20Coxon%2C%20who%20previously%20worked%20at%20OpenAI%2C%20recently%20announced%20he%20was%20leaving%20Anthropic%20and%20wrote%20that%20AI%20companies%20were%20%26quot%3Bgambling%20with%20our%20lives.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cdiv%3ERead%20the%20original%20article%20on%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fwhat-makes-ai-different-from-nuclear-war-climate-change-asteroids-2026-9%5C%22%3EBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%22%2C%22published%22%3A1789147318000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa40975cc23a829a3b904fb%3Fformat%3Djpeg%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fwhat-makes-ai-different-from-nuclear-war-climate-change-asteroids-2026-9%22%2C%22summary%22%3A%22Superintelligent%20AI%20is%20one%20of%20many%20modern%20threats%20humanity%20faces.%20Former%20DeepMind%20researcher%20Ramana%20Kumar%20explains%20what%20could%20make%20it%20uniquely%20dangerous.%22%2C%22author%22%3A%22rmakhoul%40businessinsider.com%20(Reem%20Makhoul%2CJessica%20Orwig)%22%2C%22engagement%22%3A10%2C%22canonicalUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22cdnAmpUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22ampUrl%22%3A%22%22%7D%2C%7B%22title%22%3A%22A%2027-year-old%20Tennessee%20diesel%20mechanic%20wanted%20to%20farm%20full-time%3B%20solar%20sites%20gave%20his%20sheep...%22%2C%22content%22%3A%22%22%2C%22published%22%3A1789147277000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fstatic.toiimg.com%2Fphoto%2Fmsid-134081503%2Cimgsize-1381231.cms%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Ftimesofindia.indiatimes.com%2Fworld%2Fus%2Fa-27-year-old-tennessee-diesel-mechanic-wanted-to-farm-full-time-solar-sites-gave-his-sheep-400-acres-to-graze-letting-him-quit-his-job-and-build-a-300-ewe-flock%2Farticleshow%2F134076926.cms%22%2C%22summary%22%3A%22%3Cimg%20border%3D%5C%220%5C%22%20align%3D%5C%22left%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Ftimesofindia.indiatimes.com%2Fphoto%2F134076926.cms%5C%22%20hspace%3D%5C%2210%5C%22%3ESolar%20grazing%20offers%20new%20opportunities%20for%20small%20livestock%20farmers%20across%20the%20American%20South.%20This%20practice%20uses%20sheep%20to%20manage%20vegetation%20beneath%20solar%20panels%2C%20benefiting%20both%20farmers%20