0but%20also%20exposes%20systems%20to%20cyber%20threats%2C%20experts%20say.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3ESupply%20chain%20cyberattacks%20disrupt%20operations%2C%20prompting%20calls%20for%20AI-enhanced%20cybersecurity%20measures.%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%3Cp%3EIn%20mid-August%2C%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fai-trucking-logistics-uber-freight-tech-optimize-routes-2025-4%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EUber%20Freight%3C%2Fa%3E%20revealed%20a%20cybersecurity%20incident%20involving%20unauthorized%20access%20to%20a%20portion%20of%20its%20systems%20and%20data.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EDays%20prior%2C%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Freverse-logistics-experts-executives-wrangling-e-commerce-returns-power-players-2022-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3ECeva%20Logistics%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20a%20subsidiary%20of%20CMA%20CGM%2C%20reported%20a%20data%20breach%20that%20affected%20numerous%20companies%20and%20leaked%20their%20customers'%20personal%20information.%20Weeks%20before%20that%2C%20Coca-Cola's%20dairy%20brand%20Fairlife%20was%20hit%20by%20a%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fwhat-to-know-about-the-growing-threat-of-ransomware-attacks-2021-11%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Eransomware%20attack%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20prompting%20the%20company%20to%20temporarily%20suspend%20its%20US%20operations.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EConcerns%20around%20supply%20chain%20hacks%20are%20only%20growing%2C%20%26quot%3Bas%20we%20do%20more%20and%20more%20intelligent%20things%20with%20these%20computers%20and%20as%20more%20and%20more%20they're%20becoming%20the%20brain%20of%20an%20autonomous%20system%2C%26quot%3B%20Said%20Ouissal%2C%20the%20founder%20%26amp%3B%20CEO%20of%20the%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fai-edge-computing-5g-cloud-artificial-intelligence-2024-3%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Eedge-computing%20software%3C%2Fa%3E%20company%20ZEDEDA%2C%20told%20Business%20Insider.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EWarehouses%20and%20plants%20are%20adopting%20AI%20technologies%20like%20trackers%20on%20trucks%20and%20forklifts%2C%20cameras%20and%20temperature%20sensors%20inside%20facilities%2C%20laptops%20and%20tablets%2C%20and%20GPS%20systems.%20As%20they%20do%2C%20they're%20becoming%20more%20vulnerable%20to%20cybersecurity%20incidents%2C%20said%20Bart%20Bullard%2C%20the%20chief%20technology%20officer%20of%20Source%20Logistics%2C%20a%20warehousing%2C%20fulfillment%2C%20and%20transportation%20provider.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIt's%20a%20catch-22%3A%20the%20very%20technologies%20that%20supply%20chain%20operators%20use%20to%20stay%20competitive%20are%20also%20%26quot%3Bvectors%20of%20entry%26quot%3B%20for%20hackers%20to%20gain%20access%20to%20company%20systems%2C%20Bullard%20said.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAs%20supply%20chain%20executives%20grapple%20with%20this%20increasingly%20common%20challenge%2C%20they're%20also%20finding%20that%20AI%20can%20be%20a%20part%20of%20the%20solution%2C%20Ouissal%20said.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22f4169eeb-38ab-4861-834d-915751319cae%5C%22%3E%3Cstrong%3EWhat's%20at%20stake%20in%20a%20supply%20chain%20cyberattack%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EWhen%20a%20data%20breach%20occurs%2C%20companies%20will%20shut%20down%20their%20systems%20until%20they%20can%20identify%20the%20source%20of%20the%20issue.%20That%20can%20take%20an%20average%20of%20247%20days%2C%20according%20to%20an%20IBM%20report%20this%20year.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ESupply%20chain%20attacks%20are%20particularly%20problematic%20because%20a%20data%20breach%20that%20suspends%20operations%20can%20disrupt%20the%20timing%20of%20the%20entire%20supply%20chain.%20Production%20is%20delayed%20and%20products%20could%20expire%2C%20Bullard%20said.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThat's%20what%20happened%20when%20Jaguar%20Land%20Rover%20was%20hit%20by%20a%20cyber%20attack%20last%20fall.%20Production%20halted%20for%20six%20weeks.%20During%20the%20shutdown%2C%20suppliers%20lost%20work%2C%20and%20some%20small%20companies%20went%20out%20of%20business%2C%20said%20Liz%20James%2C%20a%20managing%20security%20consultant%20at%20cybersecurity%20firm%20NCC%20Group.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAttacks%20also%20occur%20within%20the%20software%20supply%20chain%2C%20Ouissal%20said.%20A%20bad%20actor%20hacks%20a%20piece%20of%20software%2C%20which%20then%20gets%20distributed%20to%20multiple%20businesses%20operating%20robots.%20The%20result%20is%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fmicrosoft-thwarts-massive-botnet-that-could-have-targeted-elections-2020-10%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Emalware%20running%20the%20bots%3C%2Fa%3E.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThis%20type%20of%20attack%20was%20disclosed%20last%20month%20by%20CloudSEK%20and%20Hudson%20Rock.%20The%20groups%20revealed%20that%20a%20software%20supply%20chain%20attack%20poisoned%20the%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fmercor-lawsuits-data-breach-2026-4%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Eopen-source%20tool%20LiteLLM%3C%2Fa%3E%20in%20March%202026.%20The%20data%20breach%20exposed%20cloud%20keys%2C%20credentials%2C%20and%20terabytes%20of%20data%20across%20more%20than%202%2C500%20organizations.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22687da858-b916-46ea-9482-0760831b197d%5C%22%3E%3Cstrong%3EPreventing%20cyberattacks%20and%20responding%20with%20AI%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EFighting%20cyberattacks%20in%20the%20supply%20chain%20requires%20both%20preventing%20and%20responding%20to%20them%20%E2%80%94%20often%20with%20the%20assistance%20of%20AI-enabled%20tools%2C%20as%20well%20as%20human%20training%20and%20expectation-setting%2C%20Ouissal%20said.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ECompanies%20use%20AI%20to%20scan%20software%20and%20detect%20hidden%20vulnerabilities%20that%20humans%20haven't%20noticed.%20AI%20tools%20are%20programmed%20to%20detect%20oddities%20that%20deviate%20from%20standard%20patterns.%20If%20there's%20an%20unexpected%20issue%2C%20the%20company%20can%20immediately%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fai-security-gap-companies-researcher-sander-schulhoff-2025-12%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Edeploy%20a%20patch%3C%2Fa%3E%20to%20prevent%20hackers%20from%20exploiting%20the%20vulnerabilities.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EBob%20Krohn%2C%20a%20partner%20and%20manufacturing%20practice%20co-leader%20at%20consulting%20firm%20ISG%2C%20said%20it's%20important%20to%20train%20employees%20on%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fways-to-protect-yourself-from-hacks-or-scams-2024-12%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Ecybersecurity%20best%20practices%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20from%20the%20C-suite%20and%20white-collar%20supervisors%20to%20the%20shop%20floor.%20Workers%20should%20be%20trained%20to%20spot%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fai-phishing-scams-automation-detection-2024-6%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Ephishing%20scams%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20and%20employees%20with%20critical%20system%20access%20should%20use%20password%20managers%2C%20Bullard%20said.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BEveryone%20in%20an%20enterprise%20must%20become%20AI-security%20forward%20thinkers%2C%26quot%3B%20Bullard%20said.%20He%20added%20that%20detecting%20attacks%20is%20increasingly%20challenging%2C%20as%20deepfake%20videos%20and%20voice%20calls%20become%20more%20sophisticated%2C%20and%20AI%20becomes%20more%20convincing%20at%20emulating%20behavior.%20The%20usual%20tells%20of%20a%20phishing%20scam%20%E2%80%94%20like%20odd%20grammar%20and%20misspelled%20words%20%E2%80%94%20disappear%20with%20the%20help%20of%20AI%2C%20Bullard%20said.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ECyber%20attacks%20in%20the%20supply%20chain%20are%20also%20changing%20how%20businesses%20approach%20supplier%20contracts%20and%20audits%2C%20James%20said.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ETwenty%20years%20ago%2C%20many%20businesses%20were%20accustomed%20to%20buying%20the%20same%20parts%20from%20the%20same%20suppliers%20for%20decades%2C%20according%20to%20Krohn.%20Now%2C%20companies%20tend%20to%20have%20diversified%20suppliers%20to%20manage%20risks%20like%20tariffs.%20Each%20time%20they%20work%20with%20another%20business%2C%20they%20have%20to%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fopenai-collective-action-cyber-defense-anthropic-hugging-face-hack-2026-8%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Econsider%20new%20cyber%20threats%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20since%20these%20entities%20can%20view%20business%20data%20and%20inventory%20levels%2C%20Krohn%20said.%20While%20firewalls%20exist%2C%20there%20are%20still%20gaps%20that%20a%20bad%20actor%20could%20exploit.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BYou%20are%20opening%20yourselves%20up%20to%20cyber%20risk%20in%20an%20exponential%20way%2C%26quot%3B%20Krohn%20said.%20He%20added%3A%20%26quot%3BChoose%20your%20supply%20chain%20partners%20carefully.%20Make%20sure%20that%20they%20have%20the%20same%20sort%20of%20emphasis%20on%20cyber%20policies%20as%20you%20do.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThat%20said%2C%20not%20all%20attacks%20can%20be%20proactively%20prevented.%20%26quot%3BAll%20our%20C-suite%20clients%20recognize%20that%20they%20are%20going%20to%20get%20hacked%2C%26quot%3B%20Krohn%20said.%20That's%20why%20executives%20are%20focused%20on%20having%20plans%20in%20place%20to%20respond%20to%20a%20cyberattack.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EBattling%20cyberattacks%20with%20the%20help%20of%20AI%20is%20critical%20because%20hackers%20using%20AI%20can%20mine%20software%20code%20for%20vulnerabilities%20much%20faster%20than%20a%20human%20can%2C%20said%20Bullard.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BFighting%20AI%20with%20AI%20is%20the%20only%20real%20avenue%2C%26quot%3B%20Bullard%20said.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cdiv%3ERead%20the%20original%20article%20on%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fsupply-chain-cyberattacks-ai-to-fight-ai-2026-9%5C%22%3EBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%22%2C%22published%22%3A1789146737000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa3174bcc23a829a3b901c8%3Fformat%3Djpeg%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fsupply-chain-cyberattacks-ai-to-fight-ai-2026-9%22%2C%22summary%22%3A%22Uber%20Freight%2C%20Ceva%20Logistics%2C%20and%20Fairlife%20experience%20cyberattacks%2C%20spotlighting%20AI's%20dual%20role%20as%20both%20risk%20and%20remedy%20in%20supply%20chains.%22%2C%22author%22%3A%22insider%40insider.com%20(Shefali%20Kapadia)%22%2C%22engagement%22%3A0%2C%22canonicalUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22cdnAmpUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22ampUrl%22%3A%22%22%7D%2C%7B%22title%22%3A%22BofA%20says%20record-high%20diesel%20is%20a%20%E2%80%98real-economy%20pressure%20point%E2%80%99%20that's%20flashing%20a%20warning%22%2C%22content%22%3A%22%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%224000%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Shell%20fuel%20price%20sign%20displays%20gasoline%20and%20renewable%20diesel%20prices%20against%20a%20bright%20blue%20sky.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa40415cc23a829a3b904c9%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%222666%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3E%3Cp%3EBloomberg%2FGetty%20Images%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cul%3E%3Cli%3EDiesel%20prices%20in%20the%20US%20hit%20%246%20per%20gallon%20for%20the%20first%20time%20on%20Friday%20amid%20oil's%20latest%20surge.%20%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EBofA%20warns%20that%20high%20diesel%20costs%20are%20a%20%26quot%3Bpressure%20point%26quot%3B%20for%20the%20economy.%20%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3E%26quot%3BRecord%20diesel%20prices%20will%20impact%20every%20cargo%2C%20shipment%2C%20every%20delivery%20Americans%20are%20taking%2C%26quot%3B%20GasBuddy%20said.%20%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20market's%20attention%20may%20be%20on%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fbusinessinsider.com%2Fbond-market-treasury-yields-10-year-inflation-economy-stock-market-2026-9%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Erising%20bond%20yields%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20but%20Bank%20of%20America%20says%20there's%20a%20more%20immediate%20concern%20for%20the%20economy%20already%20feeling%20the%20sting%20of%20high%20energy%20costs.%20%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EDiesel%20prices%20set%20a%20new%20record%20on%20Thursday%2C%20topping%20%246%20per%20gallon%20for%20the%20first%20time%20ever%20in%20the%20US.%20Investors%20are%20already%20attuned%20to%20crude%20oil%20prices%2C%20which%20have%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Foil-price-forecasts-global-shock-iran-war-wall-street-outlook-2026-9%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Eclimbed%20past%20%24100%3C%2Fa%3E%20per%20barrel%20and%20pushed%20up%20the%20cost%20of%20regular%20gas%2C%20but%20BofA%20says%20markets%20are%20underestimating%20the%20broader%20impact%20of%20surging%20diesel.%20%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20combination%20of%20geopolitical%20tensions%20and%20global%20refining%20constraints%20has%20kept%20energy%20markets%20in%20focus%20as%20princes%20continue%20trending%20upward.%20In%20BofA's%20view%2C%20markets%20need%20to%20pay%20attention%20to%20the%20cost%20of%20diesel%20as%20a%20source%20of%20volatility%2C%20as%20it%20is%20the%20fuel%20source%20for%20much%20of%20the%20commercial%20economy.%20%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BMarkets%20stop%20panicking%20when%20policymakers%20start%20panicking%E2%80%A6but%20no%20panic%20anywhere%20despite%20the%20highest%2030yr%20yield%20since%20Jun'07%20and%20spiking%20commodities%3B%20oil%20at%20%24100%2Fbbl%20takes%20headlines%20but%20diesel%20is%20the%20key%20real-economy%20pressure%20point%3A%20shipping%2C%20trucking%2C%20agriculture%2C%20construction%2C%20mining%2C%26quot%3B%20BofA%20wrote%20in%20a%20note%20to%20investors%20on%20Friday.%20%26quot%3BBlas%C3%A9%20markets%20%2B%20bravado%20policy%20%3D%20recipe%20for%20volatility.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EGas%20market%20intelligence%20platform%20GasBuddy%20said%20that%20while%20the%20headlines%20are%20focused%20on%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Foil-prices-today-100-barrel-gas-prices-iran-war-attacks-2026-9%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Ethe%20price%20of%20gasoline%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20record-high%20diesel%20costs%20are%20too%20important%20to%20ignore.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BNot%20every%20day%20are%20new%20all-time%20records%20set%2C%20and%20this%20will%20be%20a%20particularly%20painful%20one%20for%20the%20economy%20that%20may%20not%20even%20be%20immediately%20felt%2C%20but%20record%20diesel%20prices%20will%20impact%20every%20cargo%2C%20shipment%2C%20every%20delivery%20Americans%20are%20taking%2C%20and%20are%20likely%20to%20reignite%20inflation%20up%20and%20down%20the%20supply%20chain%2C%26quot%3B%20said%20Patrick%20De%20Haan%2C%20GasBuddy's%20head%20of%20petroleum%20analysis.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EGasbuddy%20noted%20that%20the%20prices%20of%20household%20goods%20and%20groceries%20are%20likely%20to%20be%20driven%20upward%20by%20higher%20diesel%20costs.%20That%20comes%20at%20a%20time%20when%20inflation%20weighing%20on%20consumer%20sentiment%2C%20and%20continues%20to%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fcpi-inflation-august-consumer-price-index-2026-9%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Eoutpace%20wage%20growth%3C%2Fa%3E.%20%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EFinance%20pros%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Foil-prices-brent-crude-futures-price-gas-diesel-jet-fuel-2026-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Ehave%20predicted%3C%2Fa%3E%20recently%20that%20even%20while%20gas%20and%20diesel%20prices%20rise%2C%20the%20coming%20energy%20shock%20may%20be%20even%20larger%20market%20watchers%20are%20anticipating.%20The%20average%20cost%20of%20diesel%20fuel%20in%20the%20US%20has%20risen%20about%2060%25%20since%20the%20Iran%20war%20broke%20out%20in%20February.%20%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cdiv%3ERead%20the%20original%20article%20on%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fdiesel-record-price-economic-impact-shipping-freight-gas-bofa-2026-9%5C%22%3EBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%22%2C%22published%22%3A1789146583000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa4132ecc23a829a3b9055a%3Fformat%3Djpeg%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fdiesel-record-price-economic-impact-shipping-freight-gas-bofa-2026-9%22%2C%22summary%22%3A%22The%20cost%20of%20diesel%20hit%20%246%20a%20gallon%20for%20the%20first%20time%20ever%20this%20week.%20It%20could%20be%20another%20blow%20to%20consumers%20already%20feeling%20the%20sting%20of%20high%20inflation.%22%2C%22author%22%3A%22sobrient%40insider.com%20(Samuel%20O'Brient)%22%2C%22engagement%22%3A95%2C%22canonicalUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22cdnAmpUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22ampUrl%22%3A%22%22%7D%2C%7B%22title%22%3A%22Why%20moms%20on%20your%20social%20feed%20are%20suddenly%20saying%20not%20to%20post%20your%20kids'%20pics%20anymore%22%2C%22content%22%3A%22%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%224800%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22A%20parent%20taking%20photos%20of%20children%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa42770ec15fe2d3cf16499%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%222700%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3E%3Cp%3EMTStock%20Studio%2FGetty%20Images%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cul%3E%3Cli%3EThe%20parenting%20debate%20about%20how%20much%20to%20share%20photos%20of%20kids%20is%20changing%20because%20of%20AI.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EA%20viral%20video%20about%20Meta%20AI's%20suggested%20questions%20has%20people%20worried.%20Meta%20said%20they%20were%20a%20mistake%20that%20has%20been%20fixed.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EFears%20that%20children's%20photos%20may%20be%20used%20for%20CSAM%20is%20changing%20how%20parents%20and%20photographers%20share%20online.%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20debate%20about%20whether%20or%20not%20to%20post%20your%20kids'%20faces%20on%20social%20media%20isn't%20new.%20I%20have%20friends%20whose%20kids%20are%20in%20college%20now%20who%20I%20remember%20struggled%20with%20the%20decision%20about%20whether%20to%20post%20baby%20photos%20to%20Instagram.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EBut%20very%20recently%2C%20that%20conversation%20has%20taken%20a%20significant%20turn%20because%20of%20concerns%20about%20AI%20%E2%80%94%20and%20even%20prompted%20Meta%20to%20take%20action.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ETwo%20viral%20things%20have%20happened%20on%20Instagram%20in%20the%20last%20week%20or%20so%2C%20with%20pretty%20different%20origins%20but%20ultimately%20the%20same%20result%3A%20parents%20saying%20that%20they%20shouldn't%20post%20images%20of%20their%20children%20online%20anymore.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20first%20was%20a%20viral%20Instagram%20from%20Kalie%20Robins%2C%20a%20mom%20in%20Utah.%20Robins%20was%20shocked%20and%20creeped%20out%20when%20she%20noticed%20Meta%20AI%20suggestions%20on%20a%20video%20she%20had%20posted%20of%20herself%20and%20her%20kid.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20Meta%20AI%20chatbot%20suggested%20questions%20like%20%26quot%3Bwho's%20the%20child%20passenger%3F%26quot%3B%20Following%20more%20of%20the%20Meta%20AI%20questions%2C%20Robins%20found%20that%20it%20pulled%20photos%20of%20her%20that%20she%20believed%20had%20been%20deleted%2C%20and%20information%20about%20her%20kids%20from%20her%20mother's%20Facebook%20page.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cdiv%20data-script%3D%5C%22%2F%2Fwww.instagram.com%2Fembed.js%5C%22%20data-styles%3D%5C%22default-width%5C%22%20data-embed-type%3D%5C%22custom%5C%22%20data-type%3D%5C%22embed%5C%22%3E%3Cblockquote%20data-instgrm-version%3D%5C%2214%5C%22%20data-instgrm-permalink%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.instagram.com%2Freel%2FDcy8LU3S7DF%2F%3Futm_source%3Dig_embed%26amp%3Butm_campaign%3Dloading%5C%22%3E%3Cdiv%3E%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.instagram.com%2Freel%2FDcy8LU3S7DF%2F%3Futm_source%3Dig_embed%26utm_campaign%3Dloading%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3E%20%3Cdiv%3E%20%3Cdiv%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%20%3Cdiv%3E%20%3Cdiv%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%20%3Cdiv%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%20%3Cdiv%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3E%20%3Cdiv%3EView%20this%20post%20on%20Instagram%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%20%3Cdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3E%20%3Cdiv%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%20%3Cdiv%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%20%3Cdiv%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3E%20%3Cdiv%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%20%3Cdiv%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3E%20%3Cdiv%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%20%3Cdiv%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%20%3Cdiv%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%20%3Cdiv%3E%20%3Cdiv%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%20%3Cdiv%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3C%2Fa%3E%3Cp%3E%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.instagram.com%2Freel%2FDcy8LU3S7DF%2F%3Futm_source%3Dig_embed%26utm_campaign%3Dloading%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EA%20post%20shared%20by%20Kalie%20%7C%20Travel%20Mom%20Creator%20(%40kontheinside)%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3C%2Fblockquote%3E%5Cn%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cp%3EWhile%20yes%2C%20Meta%20AI%20was%20pulling%20information%20that%20already%20exists%20online%2C%20it%20was%20also%20suggesting%20questions%20about%20the%20identity%20of%20children%20%E2%80%94%20potentially%20suggesting%20that%20to%20strangers%20(it's%20unclear%20if%20only%20Kalie%20saw%20this%20set%20of%20Meta%20AI%20questions%20or%20if%20a%20stranger%20would%20have%20been%20suggested%20different%20ones).%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EMeta%20told%20me%20that%20these%20AI%20suggestions%20were%20a%20mistake%20that%20had%20since%20been%20fixed.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BWhen%20someone%20clicks%20on%20a%20prompt%20and%20uses%20this%20feature%2C%20the%20response%20it%20generates%20is%20based%20on%20information%20the%20user%20already%20has%20access%20to%2C%26quot%3B%20said%20Meta%20spokesperson%20Andy%20Stone.%20%26quot%3BBut%20we%20missed%20the%20mark%20because%20the%20feature%20never%20should%20have%20prompted%20the%20individual%20with%20questions%20like%20that%20and%20we've%20fixed%20that%20issue.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%226cb8e228-75ce-4296-bfbf-75dd55634fa7%5C%22%3EMeta%20AI%20suggested%20questions%20about%20her%20kids%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EI%20spoke%20with%20Robins%2C%20and%20she%20expressed%20that%20she%20wasn't%20unaware%20of%20how%20Meta%20AI%20was%20able%20to%20pull%20up%20the%20information.%20To%20her%2C%20it%20was%20a%20stark%20reminder%20of%20just%20how%20much%20of%20our%20data%20is%20on%20social%20media%2C%20even%20if%20we%20don't%20realize%20it.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BI%20thought%20I%20was%20so%20careful%20because%20I%20never%20did%20the%20back-to-school%20photos%20with%20the%20school%20and%20teacher%20name.%20I%20never%20posted%20in%20front%20of%20any%20landmarks%20or%20in%20front%20of%20our%20house%20with%20street%20signs.%20I%20never%20did%20any%20of%20that%2C%26quot%3B%20she%20told%20me.%20%26quot%3BI%20thought%20I%20was%20being%20so%20careful%20and%20ultimately%20that%20didn't%20matter.%20It%20didn't%20even%20get%20that%20info%20from%20me.%20It%20got%20it%20from%20other%20people%2C%20so%20it%20didn't%20matter%20how%20careful%20I%20was%20being%20in%20this%20case.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20online%20reaction%20to%20Robins'%20video%20was%20twofold%3A%20first%2C%20that%20Meta%20AI%20did%20something%20creepy%20and%20off-putting%20(which%20even%20Meta%20agrees%20with)%2C%20and%20that%20this%20is%20a%20good%20reminder%20for%20parents%20to%20be%20wary%20of%20what%20information%20is%20out%20there%20about%20their%20kids%20and%20any%20photos%20they%20post.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22e5a8b253-8488-4969-b7cb-5b60724711b6%5C%22%3EProfessional%20photographers%20are%20shying%20away%20from%20sharing%20kid%20photos%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EAt%20the%20same%20time%2C%20another%20viral%20trend%20on%20Instagram%20is%20making%20people%20rethink%20how%20kids'%20images%20are%20posted%20online.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EA%20bunch%20of%20professional%20family%20photographers%2C%20nearly%20all%20women%20or%20mothers%20themselves%2C%20have%20been%20posting%20notices%20announcing%20a%20new%20policy%20that%20they%20won't%20share%20kids'%20faces%20on%20social%20media%20or%20their%20professional%20websites%20anymore.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20concern%20here%20is%20over%20AI-generated%20child%20sexual%20abuse%20material%20(CSAM)%2C%20and%20the%20risk%20that%20photos%20posted%20to%20social%20media%20could%20be%20used%20to%20either%20create%20deepfakes%20of%20specific%20children%2C%20or%20that%20their%20faces%20could%20end%20up%20in%20data%20training%20for%20AI%20models%20that%20end%20up%20creating%20this%20kind%20of%20content.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThis%20is%20a%20legitimate%20concern%2C%20and%20there%20have%20been%20criminal%20cases%20involving%20AI-generated%20CSAM%2C%20some%20gaining%20national%20media%20attention.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%226a26eb9d-262e-42db-8155-4fc3f83d081b%5C%22%3EA%20recent%20legal%20ruling%20about%20AI%20CSAM%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EA%20judge's%20recent%20ruling%20in%20a%20criminal%20case%20about%20AI-generated%20CSAM%20has%20gone%20viral%20in%20some%20Instagram%20parenting%20circles.%20The%20details%20of%20the%20legal%20ruling%20are%20complex%20(there's%20some%20great%20detail%20here%20in%20the%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.washingtonpost.com%2Ftechnology%2F2026%2F08%2F26%2Ffederal-judge-warns-law-is-being-left-behind-by-ai-sex-abuse-images%2F%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EWashington%20Post%20story%3C%2Fa%3E%20about%20it)%2C%20but%20the%20short%20version%20is%20that%20the%20judge%20wrote%20that%20there's%20a%20legal%20precedent%20that%20possession%20(not%20production%20or%20distribution)%20of%20AI-generated%20child%20pornography%20is%20protected%20as%20free%20speech.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20implications%20of%20the%20ruling%20%E2%80%94%20and%20what%20it%20means%20for%20innocent%20photos%20of%20kids%20%E2%80%94%20is%20what%20is%20now%20going%20viral%20on%20Instagram.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Flightinthedarkphoto.mypixieset.com%2F%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EHannah%20Haggard%2C%20a%20family%20and%20wedding%20photographer%3C%2Fa%3E%20based%20in%20Kentucky%2C%20posted%20to%20her%20Instagram%20that%20she%20was%20changing%20her%20policies%2C%20and%20will%20not%20post%20any%20kids'%20faces%20%E2%80%94%20even%20with%20parents'%20permission.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cdiv%20data-script%3D%5C%22%2F%2Fwww.instagram.com%2Fembed.js%5C%22%20data-styles%3D%5C%22default-width%5C%22%20data-embed-type%3D%5C%22custom%5C%22%20data-type%3D%5C%22embed%5C%22%3E%3Cblockquote%20data-instgrm-captioned%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20data-instgrm-version%3D%5C%2214%5C%22%20data-instgrm-permalink%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.instagram.com%2Fp%2FDc14O_QxuT_%2F%3Futm_source%3Dig_embed%26amp%3Butm_campaign%3Dloading%5C%22%3E%3Cdiv%3E%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.instagram.com%2Fp%2FDc14O_QxuT_%2F%3Futm_source%3Dig_embed%26utm_campaign%3Dloading%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3E%20%3Cdiv%3E%20%3Cdiv%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%20%3Cdiv%3E%20%3Cdiv%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%20%3Cdiv%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%20%3Cdiv%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3E%20%3Cdiv%3EView%20this%20post%20on%20Instagram%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%20%3Cdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3E%20%3Cdiv%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%20%3Cdiv%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%20%3Cdiv%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3E%20%3Cdiv%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%20%3Cdiv%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3E%20%3Cdiv%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%20%3Cdiv%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%20%3Cdiv%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%20%3Cdiv%3E%20%3Cdiv%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%20%3Cdiv%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3C%2Fa%3E%3Cp%3E%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.instagram.com%2Fp%2FDc14O_QxuT_%2F%3Futm_source%3Dig_embed%26utm_campaign%3Dloading%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EA%20post%20shared%20by%20Hannah%20%7C%20Light%20in%20the%20Dark%20Photography%20%7C%20KY%20Photographer%20(%40hannyhagg)%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3C%2Fblockquote%3E%5Cn%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BI'd%20been%20toying%20with%20the%20idea%20already%2C%26quot%3B%20Haggard%20told%20me.%20%26quot%3BI%20never%20post%20without%20consent%2C%20but%20I%20still%20was%20already%20considering%20it.%20Then%20once%20the%20ruling%20happened%2C%20it%20was%20confirmation%20that%20that's%20what%20needed%20to%20happen.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EA%20lot%20of%20the%20online%20reaction%20I've%20seen%20seems%20outraged%20at%20the%20ruling%2C%20which%20at%20a%20glance%20seems%20to%20be%20good%20news%20for%20child%20predators.%20But%20Mariefaye%20Bechrakis%2C%20a%20lawyer%20specializing%20in%20human%20rights%20and%20child%20rights%20who%20has%20written%20about%20AI-generated%20CSAM%20legal%20issues%20for%20the%20American%20Bar%20Association%2C%20says%20that%20it's%20more%20nuanced.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BWhat%20is%20important%20to%20note%20is%20that%20the%20judges%20are%20flashing%20a%20green%20light%20for%20a%20future%20appeal%2C%26quot%3B%20Bechrakis%20told%20me%20about%20her%20opinion%20of%20the%20judge's%20ruling.%20%26quot%3BThey%20basically%20gave%20a%20future%20roadmap%20and%20a%20real%20opportunity%20to%20future%20prosecutors.%20They%20noted%20that%20modern%20AI%20models%20don't%20create%20images%20out%20of%20thin%20air%2C%20but%20that%20they%20must%20be%20trained%20on%20large%20datasets.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EKatey%20Sutton%2C%20a%20family%20photographer%20in%20Missouri%2C%20also%20posted%20about%20her%20policy%20of%20not%20showing%20kids'%20faces%20on%20the%20internet.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BI%20don't%20believe%20AI%20is%20truly%20'synthetic'%2C%26quot%3B%20she%20told%20me.%20%26quot%3BIt's%20known%20that%20AI%20scrapes%20the%20internet%20and%20uses%20information%20it's%20given%2Ffinds%20to%20inform%2C%20recommend%2C%20create%2C%20etc%E2%80%A6%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ETake%20a%20scroll%20through%20Facebook%20or%20Instagram%2C%20and%20you'll%20see%20that%20clearly%20not%20all%20parents%20have%20ceased%20posting%20kid%20pics.%20But%20for%20some%20people%2C%20these%20recent%20AI%20scares%20are%20making%20them%20think%20carefully%20about%20the%20risks%20before%20posting.%20And%20that's%20probably%20a%20good%20thing.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cdiv%3ERead%20the%20original%20article%20on%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fparents-stop-posting-kid-photos-ai-fears-meta-ai-suggestions-2026-9%5C%22%3EBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%22%2C%22published%22%3A1789146419000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa42786cc23a829a3b9063c%3Fformat%3Djpeg%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fparents-stop-posting-kid-photos-ai-fears-meta-ai-suggestions-2026-9%22%2C%22summary%22%3A%22A%20viral%20video%20about%20Meta%20AI's%20suggested%20questions%20has%20parents%20worried.%20Meta%20said%20the%20AI%20suggestions%20were%20a%20mistake%20that%20has%20been%20fixed.%22%2C%22author%22%3A%22knotopoulos%40businessinsider.com%20(Katie%20Notopoulos)%22%2C%22engagement%22%3A95%2C%22canonicalUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22cdnAmpUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22ampUrl%22%3A%22%22%7D%2C%7B%22title%22%3A%22FM%20Sitharaman%20for%20AI%20safeguards%20to%20keep%20pace%20with%20rapid%20tech%20evolution%22%2C%22content%22%3A%22%22%2C%22published%22%3A1789146252000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fbsmedia.business-standard.com%2F_media%2Fbs%2Fimg%2Farticle%2F2026-09%2F11%2Fthumb%2Ffitandfill%2F1200X628%2F1789135572-5947.jpg%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.business-standard.com%2Feconomy%2Fnews%2Ffm-calls-for-ai-safeguards-to-keep-pace-with-rapid-technology-evolution-126091101246_1.html%22%2C%22summary%22%3A%22Finance%20Minister%20Nirmala%20Sitharaman%20calls%20for%20stronger%20AI%20safeguards%2C%20human%20oversight%20and%20regulatory%20coordination%20while%20warning%20against%20emerging%20systemic%20risks%22%2C%22author%22%3A%22%22%2C%22engagement%22%3A93%2C%22canonicalUrl%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.business-standard.com%2Feconomy%2Fnews%2Ffm-calls-for-ai-safeguards-to-keep-pace-with-rapid-technology-evolution-126091101246_1.html%22%2C%22cdnAmpUrl%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww-business--standard-com.cdn.ampproject.org%2Fc%2Fs%2Fwww.business-standard.com%2Famp%2Feconomy%2Fnews%2Ffm-calls-for-ai-safeguards-to-keep-pace-with-rapid-technology-evolution-126091101246_1.html%22%2C%22ampUrl%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.business-standard.com%2Famp%2Feconomy%2Fnews%2Ffm-calls-for-ai-safeguards-to-keep-pace-with-rapid-technology-evolution-126091101246_1.html%22%7D%2C%7B%22title%22%3A%22Houthis%20claim%20major%20advance%20in%20Yemen%20and%20tighten%20grip%20on%20Red%20Sea%20shipping%20lane%22%2C%22content%22%3A%22%22%2C%22published%22%3A1789145914000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fichef.bbci.co.uk%2Face%2Fbranded_news%2F1200%2Fcpsprodpb%2F09dc%2Flive%2F6dac0640-adcc-11f1-a540-61c3f7fc4e6c.jpg%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.bbc.co.uk%2F