ac%20data.%20The%20rate%20has%20increased%2060%20basis%20points%20this%20year%2C%20marching%20higher%20alongside%20the%2076%20basis-point%20rise%20in%20the%2010-year%20bond%20yield.%20%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20effective%20yield%20on%20the%20ICE%20Bank%20of%20America%20US%20High%20Yield%20Index%2C%20a%20reflection%20of%20corporate%20borrowing%20costs%2C%20also%20rose%20to%207.42%25%20in%20the%20last%20week%2C%20up%2089%20basis%20points%20since%20the%20start%20of%20this%20year.%20%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%220741c9e4-4507-4d14-88c7-3890967c119c%5C%22%3EThe%20'danger%20zone'%20for%20stocks%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EHigher%20yields%20have%20also%20historically%20stoked%20fears%20about%20the%20impact%20of%20higher%20rates%20on%20risk%20assets%2C%20like%20stocks.%20In%20a%20note%20to%20clients%20earlier%20this%20year%2C%20HSBC%20said%20it%20believed%20yields%20were%20solidly%20in%20the%20%26quot%3B%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fbonds-30-year-treasury-yield-inflation-interest-rates-fed-2026-5%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Edanger%20zone%3C%2Fa%3E%26quot%3B%20when%20it%20came%20to%20the%20impact%20on%20equities.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BIf%20we%20were%20to%20break%20above%205%25%2C%20it%20would%20cause%20stresses.%20It%20absolutely%20would.%20It%20could%20potentially%20cause%20the%20risk%20asset%20space%20to%20fall%20over%2C%26quot%3B%20Garvey%20said%2C%20though%20he%20noted%20that%20the%20speed%20at%20which%20yields%20increased%20mattered%20more%20to%20the%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fbonds-bond-market-10-year-treasury-yields-rates-stocks-impact-2026-9%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Eimpact%20on%20stocks%3C%2Fa%3E%20than%20the%20actual%20yield%20itself.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20speed%20at%20which%20the%2010-year%20rose%20from%20the%204.5%25%20mark%20is%20worrying%2C%20he%20added.%20%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BYou%20could%20argue%20that%2C%20isn't%20it%20about%20time%20that%20the%20market%20uses%20it%20as%20an%20excus