re%2C%20which%20would%20mark%20the%2010-year's%20highest%20yield%20since%202000.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BThe%20danger%20period%20of%20going%20from%205%25%20to%206%25%2C%20if%20that%20was%20to%20happen%20in%20the%20next%20couple%20of%20months%2C%20it%20would%20be%20something%20quite%20difficult%20for%20the%20market%2C%26quot%3B%20he%20said%20of%20that%20risk%20scenario.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cdiv%3ERead%20the%20original%20article%20on%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fbond-market-treasury-yields-10-year-inflation-economy-stock-market-2026-9%5C%22%3EBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%22%2C%22published%22%3A1789143826000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa40241cc23a829a3b904bc%3Fformat%3Djpeg%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fbond-market-treasury-yields-10-year-inflation-economy-stock-market-2026-9%22%2C%22summary%22%3A%22The%2010-year%20Treasury%20yield%20is%20inching%20toward%205%25%2C%20a%20psychological%20threshold%20that%20represents%20a%20%26quot%3Bdanger%20zone%26quot%3B%20for%20stock%20investors.%22%2C%22author%22%3A%22jsor%40businessinsider.com%20(Jennifer%20Sor)%22%2C%22engagement%22%3A95%2C%22canonicalUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22cdnAmpUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22ampUrl%22%3A%22%22%7D%2C%7B%22title%22%3A%22Confluent%20cofounder%20says%20believing%20in%20AI's%20upside%20means%20reckoning%20with%20its%20'dark%20side'%22%2C%22content%22%3A%22%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%225120%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22A%20worker%20stares%20at%20two%20computer%20screens%20in%20a%20dark%20room.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa42063ec15fe2d3cf16435%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%222700%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EConfluent's%20cofounder%20said%20there's%20a%20'dark%20side'%20to%20good%20technologies%20%E2%80%94%20and%20that%20we%20should%20listen%20to%20recent%20fears.%3Cp%3EMTStock%20Studio%2FGetty%20Images%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cul%3E%3Cli%3EConfluent's%20cofounder%20wrote%20on%20X%20that%20AI%20fears%20can't%20be%20dismissed%20as%20a%20marketing%20ploy.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EHe's%20said%20he's%20confident%20in%20AI.%20It%20also%20has%20a%20serious%20potential%20%26quot%3Bdark%20side%2C%26quot%3B%20too.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EIt%20comes%20as%20Silicon%20Valley%20labs%20have%20faced%20a%20barrage%20of%20unnerving%20headlines.%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%3Cp%3EAI%20safety%20fears%20have%20recently%20moved%20from%20an%20abstract%20Silicon%20Valley%20argument%20to%20a%20series%20of%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fai-agents-rogue-strategies-cheating-lying-german-wiki-openai-anthropic-2026-9%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Eunnerving%20real-world%20episodes%3C%2Fa%3E.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EJay%20Kreps%2C%20a%20former%20Anthropic%20board%20member%20and%20a%20cofounder%20of%20data-streaming%20software%20company%20Confluent%2C%20says%20it%20is%20important%20to%20take%20them%20seriously.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIn%20a%20Thursday%20night%20X%20post%2C%20he%20argued%20that%20AI%20backers%20need%20to%20contend%20with%20the%20technology's%20downside%20risks%20as%20its%20capabilities%20improve%20%E2%80%94%20and%20that%20fears%20about%20those%20risks%20are%20not%20merely%20a%20cynical%20marketing%20ploy.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BMost%20positive%20use%20cases%20for%20AI%20have%20a%20corresponding%20'dark%20version%2C'%26quot%3B%20Kreps%20wrote.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EA%20system%20that%20is%20superhuman%20at%20coding%20could%20also%20be%20superhuman%20at%20hacking%2C%20he%20said.%20AI%20that%20helps%20design%20new%20drugs%20could%20also%20help%20develop%20%26quot%3Bnovel%20undetectable%20poisons.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAs%20AI's%20capabilities%20have%20improved%2C%20Silicon%20Valley%20has%20faced%20several%20unnerving%20headlines%20over%20the%20past%20couple%20of%20months.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EOn%20Tuesday%2C%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fanthropic-researcher-quits-over-ai-safety-concerns-2026-9%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%