rails%20%E2%80%94%20but%20warned%20that%20it%20has%20not%20yet%20done%20so.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BTalking%20about%20these%20issues%20is%20just%20common%20sense.%20It's%20not%20a%20sign%20of%20some%20kind%20of%20neuroticism%20or%20pessimism%2C%26quot%3B%20he%20wrote.%20%26quot%3BMocking%20people%20who%20are%20worried%20about%20this%20or%20talking%20about%20it%2C%20without%20anything%20substantive%20to%20say%20about%20how%20we%20can%20be%20sure%20these%20problems%20won't%20arise%2C%20is%20not%20really%20a%20very%20helpful%20contribution.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cdiv%3ERead%20the%20original%20article%20on%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fconfluent-cofounder-ai-dark-side-marketing-ploy-2026-9%5C%22%3EBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%22%2C%22published%22%3A1789143815000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6aa42078cc23a829a3b905d5%3Fformat%3Djpeg%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fconfluent-cofounder-ai-dark-side-marketing-ploy-2026-9%22%2C%22summary%22%3A%22Confluent's%20cofounder%2C%20Jay%20Kreps%2C%20says%20AI's%20rapid%20progress%20makes%20its%20risks%20impossible%20to%20dismiss%20as%20a%20marketing%20ploy.%22%2C%22author%22%3A%22bshimkus%40businessinsider.com%20(Ben%20Shimkus)%22%2C%22engagement%22%3A95%2C%22canonicalUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22cdnAmpUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22ampUrl%22%3A%22%22%7D%2C%7B%22title%22%3A%22San%20Jose%20woman%20arrested%20after%20video%20accusing%20father%20of%20trafficking%20his%206-year-old%20daughter%20goes%20viral%22%2C%22content%22%3A%22%22%2C%22published%22%3A1789143781000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fstatic.toiimg.com%2Fphoto%2Fmsid-134078532%2Cimgsize-47404.cms%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Ftimesofindia.indiatimes.com%2Fworld%2Fus%2Fsan-jose-woman-arrested-after-video-accusing-father-of-trafficking-his-6-year-old-daughter-goes-viral%2Farticleshow%2F134078194.cms%22%2C%22summary%22%3A%22%3Cimg%20border%3D%5C%220%5C%22%20align%3D%5C%22left%5C%22%20sr